\nVLLMEngine code was wrong on this point) -- the real mechanism is\nSamplingParams(extra_args={\"kv_transfer_params\": {...}}). A real\ncross-host prefill-to-decode KV transfer completed in ~0.23s on both\nversions, confirming the contract Task 3 needs to code against.","tree":{"sha":"ee8e6a0d9b210eeab1e6842e8748188c81f1c2ba","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/trees/ee8e6a0d9b210eeab1e6842e8748188c81f1c2ba"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/commits/1056b38aff2cc38f64badf54f13deb533104926e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5291193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elizabetht","id":5291193,"login":"elizabetht","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTExOTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commit/1056b38aff2cc38f64badf54f13deb533104926e","node_id":"C_kwDOTmk37toAKDEwNTZiMzhhZmYyY2MzOGY2NGJhZGY1NGYxM2RlYjUzMzEwNDkyNmU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commit/8397ae43b0eabd8507aff2ec19fb3bd19b66410e","sha":"8397ae43b0eabd8507aff2ec19fb3bd19b66410e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commits/8397ae43b0eabd8507aff2ec19fb3bd19b66410e"}],"sha":"1056b38aff2cc38f64badf54f13deb533104926e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commits/1056b38aff2cc38f64badf54f13deb533104926e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5291193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/elizabetht","id":5291193,"login":"elizabetht","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTExOTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commits/8397ae43b0eabd8507aff2ec19fb3bd19b66410e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:59:51Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-30T01:59:51Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"message":"docs: implementation plan for Chapter 3 (disaggregated prefill/decode)\n\nTen tasks: a hardware spike to verify vLLM''s NixlConnector wire contract,\nEngine protocol/MockEngine/VLLMEngine changes, moving KVRouter to a\nshared module, the Worker''s new /prefill route and decode-initiated\norchestration, Frontend pool filtering, manual two-host verification,\nand documentation.","tree":{"sha":"437176e56d52be17c4a28848a6939c5baaa39