ht","id":5291193,"login":"elizabetht","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjUyOTExOTM=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commits/683e283d6f8cca0c3f9f53722ebfb91fe50625b6/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T21:55:55Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T21:55:55Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"message":"docs: document cache_hit_blocks and the Engine protocol change\n\nThe Engine protocol, MockEngine, VLLMEngine, and the SGLang sketch all gained\na cache_hit_blocks parameter in the previous commit; the Worker and appendix\ndocs still showed the old generate(prompt) signature. Also documents how the\nFrontend measures and forwards the hint (cached_prefix_len before record) and\nnotes in the top-level README that the mock engine now makes routing''s payoff\nfelt, not just correct.","tree":{"sha":"19e01a29a70ff6c6b2201db3e8326f994a9fc6a5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/trees/19e01a29a70ff6c6b2201db3e8326f994a9fc6a5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/commits/683e283d6f8cca0c3f9f53722ebfb91fe50625b6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5291193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/followers","following_