repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/commits/3c35b097e53a7b51eca2bea5a7da6ab2fdbf02b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-29T20:45:35Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-29T20:45:35Z","email":"email2eliza@gmail.com","name":"elizabetht"},"message":"feat: make the KV cache hit visible with a simulated prefill delay\n\nMockEngine now splits generation into prefill + decode phases so cache-aware\nrouting actually shows a payoff. The Frontend measures how much of the\nprompt''s prefix the selected worker already holds (KVRouter.cached_prefix_len,\ncalled before record() to avoid a tautological full hit) and forwards it as\nGenerateRequest.cache_hit_blocks; MockEngine skips its simulated prefill delay\nwhen the hint is nonzero. VLLMEngine accepts the same field for protocol\nparity but ignores it, since vLLM already does real prefix caching.","tree":{"sha":"02e1fc84db9333e27e5084d09f404b42e0ecdd0f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/trees/02e1fc84db9333e27e5084d09f404b42e0ecdd0f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/elizabetht/nano-dynamo/git/commits/3c35b097e53a7b51eca2bea5a7da6ab2fdbf02b1","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/5291193?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/elizabetht/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.c