1280e5d5f3a0ac/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:22:11Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:22:11Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: a second device shows the turn another device sent\n\nA browser that had a chat cached served it from the cache whenever its\nmessage ids matched what it had last pushed, and the conversation list''s\nnewer updated_at was folded into the cached copy without anyone remembering\nthe thread was older. So a desktop that had the chat open never showed the\nphoto and PDF a phone had just sent (3 of 3 real-browser runs). This\npredates the branch: reproduced at origin/dev 3fead415.\n\nThe store now records the server''s updated_at at each read (seen) and flags\na chat stale when the list says the server wrote it later. A stale chat is\nfetched once on its next load; an unchanged one is never fetched. The read\nkeeps the ids and browser-only fields of turns the cache already holds, so\nthe next save is still an append. The chat view asks the list again when a\nchat is opened from the sidebar and when the tab comes back into view, at\nmost once every 5 seconds and never on a timer.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"227b526544fe593f75ece4c06081666c06438be2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/227b526544fe593f75ece4c06081666c06438be2"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/4436a3d741421d8f9aa47e0cc31280e5d5f3a0ac","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.