"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/d709d27496f4226e85951a65511f3f15014d6606/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:04:52Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T18:04:52Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"deps: pin trafilatura 2.2.0 and htmldate 1.10.0, the versions production runs\n\ntrafilatura 2.3.0 (published 2026-10-02 16:53 UTC) and htmldate 1.11.0\n(14:24 UTC) were picked up by the unpinned `trafilatura>=1.12` on the\nrelease w2 CI run. They change the extracted text. 19 tests went red\nacross the three orchestrator shards:\n- test_rerank_inputs_and_sources_match_dev (\"retrieve.realtime.evidence\n  moved: this turn no longer cites what dev cited\")\n- test_augmentation_can_be_switched_off (a pricing table''s \"$7.20\" now\n  survives with augmentation off)\nNone of these tests touch the release''s own changes.\n\nReproduced locally: the same three test files, with 2.3.0 and 1.11.0\noverlaid, gave 13 failed and 85 passed; with 2.2.0 and 1.10.0, 98 passed.\nThe production orchestrator image runs trafilatura 2.2.0 and htmldate\n1.10.0, and the next image build would have moved production to the new\nextractor without anyone deciding to. Both requirement files now pin\nthose two versions exactly, with a note to move them together with the\nextraction and retrieval golden suites.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4970571fd4681b815d829f5ccd25da35951c6334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/4970571fd4681b815d829f5ccd25da35951c6334"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/d709d27496f4226e85951a65511f3f15014d6606","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/d709d27496f4226e85951a65511f3f15014d6606","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKGQ3MDlkMjc0OTZmNDIyNmU4NTk1MWE2NTUxMWYzZjE1MDE0ZDY2MDY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/3fead41562a87004fac6eb687f57c2b090d5661f","sha":"3fead41562a87004fac6eb687f57c2b090d5661f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/3fead41562a87004fac6eb687f57c2b090d5661f"}],"sha":"d709d27496f4226e85951a65511f3f15014d6606","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/d709d27496f4226e85951a65511f3f15014d6606"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/32d782f1fed889b5e4d1a43365d4273d23afcdc9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:59:31Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:59:31Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: a document''s upload id survives a refused history push\n\nThe id a background upload writes onto its turn rode a whole-thread PUT\nthat the server refused (the tab''s own append, or the stored answer, had\nmoved updated_at). The recovery adopted the server''s copy, which had no\nid, and never pushed again, so no other device could open the PDF.\n\nEvery path that adopts or saves an older or server copy now carries the\nid forward onto the same file (matched by attachment_id on the same user\nturn), the recovery re-pushes once, and a second refusal keeps the\nrepaired copy in the cache for the next push. Removes the RC-3c row from\nthe operator doc''s deviation table.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"08bec03be1ada23851557d61b784c058b6d42d22","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/08bec03be1ada23851557d61b784c058b6d42d22"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/32d782f1fed889b5e4d1a43365d4273d23afcdc9","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/32d782f1fed889b5e4d1a43365d4273d23afcdc9","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDMyZDc4MmYxZmVkODg5YjVlNGQxYTQzMzY1ZDQyNzNkMjNhZmNkYzk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/940af7dada58c6c12a5a489169a263f9476ca39c","sha":"940af7dada58c6c12a5a4891