dia to conversations only. The\n  decorate query selects the recording outcome and the picture columns, and\n  each item carries has_transcript (recordings) or width/height/mime\n  (pictures). No new cursor field.\n- frontend/lib/myfiles.ts: dev''s retention sentence (\"kept for N hours, then\n  removed the next time the server clears out old files\") and swept note\n  (\"removed after N hours\") stand verbatim. The lasting document/dataset copy\n  gets its own sentence when files_kept_with_chat is set; the earlier\n  \"up to N hours\" wording is gone.\n- frontend/tests/my-files-page.test.tsx: the fake row type carries both\n  has_transcript and the picture fields.\n- docs/MY-FILES.md: the sentences and field notes as above.\n\nfrontend/tests/my-files-lib.test.ts pins the precedence. V44 stays the only\nnew migration (V1..V44 contiguous).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0940616708dd35e9acf11205f156c46a50e47d48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/0940616708dd35e9acf11205f156c46a50e47d48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/940af7dada58c6c12a5a489169a263f9476ca39c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_ev