.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: the operator doc matches the fixes and lists every place the build differs from the contract\n\nThe 40/89 MP ceiling, the share-policy gap, the per-chat upload list and the\nlasting-copy reaper''s home were stale after the fix rounds. Adds the heal, the\nadmin no-store, the branch-aware follow-up fallback, the per-member disk and\nmalformed-range limits, and a table of CONTRACT deviations with their tracks.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"39b1875f34253371e0de3a4c90f9f56b5c30a944","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/39b1875f34253371e0de3a4c90f9f56b5c30a944"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/702149af67deeb01293c98799270584b0a45e52c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/702149af67deeb01293c98799270584b0a45e52c","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDcwMjE0OWFmNjdkZWViMDEyOTNjOTg3OTkyNzA1ODRiMGE0NWU1MmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/6684411e1b62f505686efbf00ab3428c747f6feb","sha":"6684411e1b62f505686efbf00ab3428c747f6feb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/6684411e1b62f505686efbf00ab3428c747f6feb"}],"sha":"702149af67deeb01293c98799270584b0a45e52c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/702149af67deeb01293c98799270584b0a45e52c"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/3fead41562a87004fac6eb687f57c2b090d5661f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:03:50Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T17:03:50Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"whisper-cpu: run the head copy at four threads, the size that passed the chat gate\n\nThe owner''s chat gate was measured on the running Qwen/Qwen3.6-35B-A3B-NVFP4.\nWith the head copy at eight threads on cores 7-9,15-19, decode cost 1.28 %\nbut time to first token rose 10.1 % against a 10 % limit, so it failed. At four\nthreads on cores 16-19 decode cost 0.07 % and time to first token rose 2.5 %,\nso it passed.\n\nThe head copy''s defaults in scripts/whisper-cpu.sh are therefore now\nWHISPER_CPU_HEAD_CPUSET=16-19, WHISPER_CPU_HEAD_CPUS=4 and\nWHISPER_CPU_HEAD_THREADS=4, and .env.example, the compose comment and the\nplacement test say the same. A value kept in .env still wins over them.\n\nThe router has no speed estimate of its own for the head copy, so the\nmeasured figure for four threads, about 0.41 s per second of audio and about\n1.8 times slower than eight threads, is recorded in\ndocs/voice/CPU-REPLICA-HEAD.md together with the gate results. That document\nno longer calls the gate unmeasured or names the 27B as the served model, and\nrecords the worker''s copy on the 35B at about 0-5 % decode cost, inside the\nnoise.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"652dd99ca31f30635be3c7c852447e4b61fb1bc0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/652dd99ca31f30635be3c7c852447e4b61fb1bc0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/3fead41562a87004fac6eb687f57c2b090d5661f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"h