a9e034f4540bdd8201bc482f7123f","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDEzNDhhNTZkMjllYTllMDM0ZjQ1NDBiZGQ4MjAxYmM0ODJmNzEyM2Y","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/509a473c74446000307aa458287ded8106d4fc0c","sha":"509a473c74446000307aa458287ded8106d4fc0c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/509a473c74446000307aa458287ded8106d4fc0c"}],"sha":"1348a56d29ea9e034f4540bdd8201bc482f7123f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/1348a56d29ea9e034f4540bdd8201bc482f7123f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/509a473c74446000307aa458287ded8106d4fc0c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:58:32Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:58:32Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat files: fixes from the QA and security attacks on the lasting copies\n\n- The lasting-copy reaper no longer runs inside upload requests. It rode the\n  upload-session sweep, which POST /uploads and chunked init also await, so\n  one person''s upload paid for a pass over every chat with files (1.2 s at\n  3000 chats). main.py''s ten-minute background loop now runs it.\n- A regenerate, edit or retry of a document turn older than the workspace\n  TTL reads the document''s lasting copy instead of saying it is gone. A zip\n  sent as a document expands from the copy too.\n- GET /uploads/{conv} reports a file with a lasting copy as ready, so the\n  workbook preview stops saying a stored file has expired.\n- A kept file whose name the path resolver refuses (\".env\", a backslash) is\n  served from its lasting copy instead of answering 404.\n- Upload names \"..\", \"dir/\" and names too long for the filesystem are\n  stored as \"upload.bin\" or shortened with their extension kept, on both\n  rails, instead of failing with a 500.\n- Conversation ids are checked with fullmatch wherever one can be claimed,\n  so \"conv\\n\" is refused instead of splitting one chat''s files across two\n  directory names that the eraser and the reaper never agree on.\n- The admin picture route answers Cache-Control: private, no-store, so a\n  repeat view is a new request and a new audit row.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0f0994f54482c8cb02ecd12084890b9566012d9f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/0f0994f54482c8cb02ecd12084890b9566012d9f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/509a473c74446000307aa458287ded8106d4fc0c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/p