kwDOTmnEa9oAKDczMjMzN2IyNThjNzRlYzdiZWZjZDcyOTQ1NTg3MWI1ZWM0ODI0Njg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985","sha":"6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985"}],"sha":"732337b258c74ec7befcd729455871b5ec482468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/732337b258c74ec7befcd729455871b5ec482468"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:41:43Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:41:43Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: the stored-picture fallback reads only a photo on the path the person sees\n\nThe message list is flat and append-only (lib/branching.ts keeps every\nedited-away version), and image_memory''s store fallback took the newest\nuser message with meta.images from it. After an edit of an earlier\nmessage, a photo on a branch nobody sees was handed to the model.\n\n/chat now passes the path the browser sent (messages) to hydrate. A\nstored picture turn counts only when it is on that path: matched by its\nwords (a pasted block or quote folded in front is allowed), or, for a\nphoto sent with no words, by an answer stored under it (branch parent or\nthe next message). turns_after is counted on the path. A caller that\nsends no history keeps the stored order alone. The stored read and its\ndownscale now run on the chat media decode pool.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"33f84935e7d32e95d961fde1fa2ca41d4a540d77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/33f84935e7d32e95d961fde1fa2ca41d4a540d77"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDZjN2VhZTMxMTkyZDQwYjAwNWJhMDExNmRiNzVjYmJmZjFiMzA5ODU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056","sha":"32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056"}],"sha":"6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/6c7eae31192d40b005ba0116db75cbbff1b30985"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:40:40Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:40:40Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media (frontend): fixes from the QA and security attacks\n\n- The \"Photo not stored on the server\" line no longer appears under text\n  follow-ups. The orchestrator answers those through the vision route too,\n  so the line now goes on at most one turn per thread: the first photo-less\n  turn under a vision answer, and only when no earlier turn has a photo or a\n  vision answer.\n- An edit that sends photos by reference first checks that the server still\n  lists them. The version is stored before its stream starts, so a 422\n  image_ref_missing used to leave an unanswered 2/2 behind that no push could\n  remove.\n- The backfill now repairs turns whose meta.images the server never stored\n  (the /chat background store was lost). It asks the server once per chat\n  and uploads the missing ids with the bytes this browser holds, under the\n  SAME ids. Nothing is rewritten. It skips turns younger than 2 minutes, bytes\n  that do not pair one to one with the references, and any chat whose list it\n  could not read.\n- Each IndexedDB photo record is now tied to the turn it was written for\n  (role plus exact words). The boot read puts a record back only on that\n  turn, and the backfill uses it only for that turn. A thread replaced under\n  an index can no longer upload an old photo into an unrelated turn. Records\n  written before this change are used only under a vision answer.\n- A stored thumbnail now retries 3 times (after 2 s, 6 s and 15 s) before it\n  shows \"Image unavailable\".\n- Logout responses carry Clear-Site-Data: \"cache\", and a removed account''s\n  session end requests one too. Stored photos are cached private and immutable\n  for a year and are served with no session check.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"3aec2b702037a7649a87c16cc660192924f88419","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/3aec2b702037a7649a87c16cc660192924f88419"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDMyZTNkOWQ1NjA4ODM5NGM4YmNhZDQ5OGUxZjUzZWI5ODFhOGUwNTY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/fa0a749b1b87b3e4a2dc16e918c7da9dcc61168c","sha":"fa0a749b1b87b3e4a2dc16e918c7da9dcc61168c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/fa0a749b1b87b3e4a2dc16e918c7da9dcc61168c"}],"sha":"32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/32e3d9d56088394c8bcad498e1f53eb981a8e056"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/fa0a749b1b87b3e4a2dc16e918c7da9dcc61168c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:37:11Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T16:37:11Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: bound picture decodes, keep phone JPEGs, heal lost files, thumbnail 16-bit grey\n\n- The store refuses any picture over 16 MP (every format, JPEG included)\n  from its header, before verify or load; a 38-byte WebP used to decode to\n  40 MP at +601 MiB. Every decode (upload route, /chat background store)\n  runs on a two-worker pool, so a burst queues instead of filling memory\n  and the default executor.\n- The JPEG end check walks marker segments to the primary picture''s EOI,\n  so a motion-photo or vendor trailer after it is ignored; MPO (a JPEG with\n  several pictures) is stored as image/jpeg. Cut files are still refused,\n  with or without an EXIF thumbnail.\n- A row whose file is gone is restored by a retry of the same bytes under\n  the same id (upload route and /chat); different bytes never replace it.\n- A 16-bit greyscale PNG no longer thumbnails as pure white.\n- A ref-only /chat turn with no words gets the image placeholder question.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e5aff656ec3889a04c837e3994f4b83120ae9ccd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/e5aff656ec3889a04c837e3994f4b83120ae9ccd"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/fa0a749b1b87b3e4a2dc16e918c7da9dcc61168c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.c