://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/a749893ca6d6aa57be6af107eb045f219d9f4392","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/a749893ca6d6aa57be6af107eb045f219d9f4392","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKGE3NDk4OTNjYTZkNmFhNTdiZTZhZjEwN2ViMDQ1ZjIxOWQ5ZjQzOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/953768272e11c02ef651fd299191aa20e22b340d","sha":"953768272e11c02ef651fd299191aa20e22b340d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/953768272e11c02ef651fd299191aa20e22b340d"}],"sha":"a749893ca6d6aa57be6af107eb045f219d9f4392","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/a749893ca6d6aa57be6af107eb045f219d9f4392"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/4a139692d6fbe7180b99fb02e5b7cdde84a46a63/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-30T12:44:55Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:28:38Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"whisper-cpu: a head copy by the owner''s exception, listed last, gated on chat decode\n\n- scripts/whisper-cpu.sh: WHISPER_CPU_NODE=head acts on the head''s copy; the\n  default is still the worker, and its path is unchanged. The head copy binds a\n  Docker bridge gateway only (172.17.0.1, like the head''s GPU replica on 30007;\n  the head''s host guard does not judge 30008, so the bind is the boundary). It\n  refuses to start under 20 GiB of MemAvailable. It compiles and converts nothing\n  on the head: it loads the worker''s image (checked by image ID) and copies the\n  worker''s q8_0 file (checked against the pin; an interrupted copy is removed).\n  Its cores are WHISPER_CPU_HEAD_CPUSET/_CPUS/_THREADS (default 7-9,15-19 / 8 / 8,\n  the configuration measured on the head), read from .env as well, so a cap\n  decided at the chat gate survives the next `up`.\n- ASR_CPU_BASE_URLS is merged, never replaced. `up` or `down` on one node leaves\n  the other node''s copy listed, and the head''s copy is always last, because the\n  router offers overflow to the list in order and the head''s cores also run the\n  orchestrator and rank 0''s engine loop.\n- compose: cpuset, cpus and threads come from the environment, with the worker''s\n  values as defaults. The worker''s rendered config is byte-identical to before.\n- scripts/whisper-cpu-chat-gate.py: the owner''s condition as a tool. It runs\n  300-token single-stream probes in interleaved on/off pairs. Only probes that\n  ran alone on the engine count. The verdict is the median paired drop against\n  5 %, with a bootstrap CI. It starts and stops nothing.\n- docs/voice/CPU-REPLICA-HEAD.md covers:\n  - per-core facts on the head;\n  - the head run of 2026-09-30 12:02: 20/20 transcripts byte-identical to the\n    worker copy, RTF 0.43/0.58 (1.3-1.6 % slower than the worker), peak 2.010 GiB;\n  - why the dense 27B needs its own chat measurement;\n  - the exact gate and deploy commands.\n  NOT deployed. The gate has not been run on nvidia/Qwen3.8-27B-NVFP4: 0 of 21\n  probes ran alone on the engine at 17:58-18:05.\n\nTests:\n- launcher test_whisper_cpu_head (25): 24 fail or error against a08a1066''s script\n  and compose file, and all pass after. The one that passes both times is the\n  worker-render invariant.\n- launcher test_whisper_cpu_chat_gate (8): new tool, pass.\n- test_network_exposure: asserts the worker cpuset through its variable.\n- orchestrator test_asr_cpu_replica: pins the two-copy order, and that the\n  dictation pool adds no permit for either copy but lends each free copy its\n  one slot (seven clips: two per GPU, one per copy, one busy).\n\nPorted onto the round-1 fixes of feat/cpu-whisper. In `up`, require_cluster is\nfollowed by `[ \"$WHISPER_CPU_NODE\" = head ] || require_host_guard`, and only the\nhead''s log line is kept after the start. The head''s copy runs the worker''s\nimage, so the busy 503 and the restart watchdog cover it unchanged\n(docs/voice/CPU-REPLICA-HEAD.md). Launcher gate: 736 executed, 1 skipped, OK.\nSpeech, voice, ASR, config and metrics tests: 559 passed, 2 skipped, 2 xfailed.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"38a6d3b4b2cb7f84f57a14a53af736ecde286bf8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/38a6d3b4b2cb7f84f57a14a53af736ecde286bf8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/4a139692d6fbe7180b99fb02e5b7cdde84a46a63","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/4a139692d6fbe7180b99fb02e5b7cdde84a46a63","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDRhMTM5NjkyZDZmYmU3MTgwYjk5ZmIwMmU1YjdjZGRlODRhNDZhNjM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab","sha":"e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab"}],"sha":"4a139692d6fbe7180b99fb02e5b7cdde84a46a63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/4a139692d6fbe7180b99fb02e5b7cdde84a46a63"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:19:43Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:19:43Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"whisper-cpu: fix the verifier''s round-1 findings\n\nThe CPU replica now refuses a clip with a 503 (\"busy: the CPU replica is\ndecoding another clip\") while it is decoding one, checked before the upload is\nread and again with no await before the lock. The router''s in-flight count\nforgets a decode whose caller let go of it, so a clip used to queue behind an\nabandoned decode and miss its deadline; the router already maps the 503 to\nASRUnavailable and takes the clip to the GPU queue in the same call.\n\nA decoder restart is now under the same kind of watchdog as a decode: a restart\nthat has not said ready within the hang budget''s fixed part is killed and is a\nWorkerDied(\"decoder did not become ready\"), counted toward the three-in-a-row\nexit.\n\nThe gated-retry rule that drops text made only of stock phrases now runs on\nthe CPU tier alone (VLLMAudioProvider passes its tier to speech_is_plausible).\nGPU dictation verdicts are identical to the fork point: the verifier''s eight\ncases and 200,000 random cases, none changed. The builder''s owner action 5 is\nno longer needed.\n\nASR_CPU_BASE_URLS keeps each replica once. The legacy dictation pool''s permits\nare the GPU replicas'' alone; a CPU replica''s slot is lent only to a clip the\nrouter would send there first at that moment (RoutedProvider.cpu_takes_next),\nso ASR_MAX_CONCURRENT per GPU replica holds while the CPU is standing down,\nbusy or too slow for the deadline.\n\nDocs: the \"never sent\" sentence is qualified, the accuracy table is stated to\ncover verbose_json only with a placeholder for the json-mode pairing, the chat\ncost numbers are labelled as the 27B''s, and the claim that the chat model''s\nworker rank stays on the A725 cores is corrected (nothing pins it; it is not\npinned now because that would restart the model).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"376a0c3b844879f6397e8a36cc13fed2841be04b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/376a0c3b844879f6397e8a36cc13fed2841be04b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKGU3ZmJlNzc2ZmY5MWFkMzAzOGViOTU5MGE4NDdmNTNjZmNlY2YxYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/d75f623860362e844804b3a6a9f22711dd42b748","sha":"d75f623860362e844804b3a6a9f22711dd42b748","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/d75f623860362e844804b3a6a9f22711dd42b748"}],"sha":"e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e7fbe776ff91ad3038eb9590a847f53cfcecf1ab"},{"aut