an"},"message":"chat media: operator doc, settings, metrics and notes for the other tracks\n\ndocs/chat-media/README.md says what is stored and where, the routes and\ntheir bodies, deletion and the reaper, the settings, the metrics, how to\nstop new writes and roll back, and the honest limits. MONITORING.md and\nCONFIG.md gain their chat media sections. NOTES.md records, for the\nfrontend and files tracks, the bodies as built, the merge order of\nimage_refs, the admin route''s real path and audit action, the files\ntrack''s hooks, and the share-policy gap for a picture-only message.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d33d668d62773894431043ca4f9377377e7c27ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/d33d668d62773894431043ca4f9377377e7c27ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/6c16cc1ccd9e312d7dd74e3c3f3216a70dee42c6","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type"