re rendering the server\nthumbnails, the two proxies (validation before fetch, streaming both ways, the\nimmutable caching headers, 304, 404/410, the 64 MiB cap), resend by reference\nand the 422 re-attach notice, the backfill rules (deterministic ids, Web Locks,\nthree chats per tick, 507 and offline stops, re-apply after a 409), the legacy\nnote, and RC-3a / RC-3c through the real ChatApp.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fc8ca605b3e0f94e939e063e9c51ad07098b9030","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/fc8ca605b3e0f94e939e063e9c51ad07098b9030"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/6a98237adaf8b4d7e398712874b9e40afb7c64f2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/6a98237adaf8b4d7e398712874b9e40af