 4.14.2 for two new CRITICAL advisories\n\nThe blocking Trivy pass on PR #92 failed on two advisories published since\nthe last green run, both with fixed versions available:\n\n- GHSA-vcvr-r3jv-pc5j (CRITICAL): remote code execution in next/og\n  ImageResponse, next 16.3.3 -> 16.3.6. This is the version production''s\n  frontend runs today, so this bump is a fix for the live app as well as\n  the release. Only next and its @next/swc-* binaries change in the lock.\n- CVE-2026-63374 (CRITICAL): TLS certificate spoofing through IDN\n  encoding in anyio, 4.13.0 -> 4.14.2, in the voice archive store''s pinned\n  requirements.\n\nChecked locally: npm ci, tsc, lint, the full vitest suite (3,862 passed,\n11 skipped), next build; the voice-store suite on anyio 4.14.2 (40\npassed, pip check clean); and the pipeline''s own Trivy image with\n--severity CRITICAL --exit-code 1, which now exits 0.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"cc0c777b99bba5ab72a8b3417a5bb0864bad51ae","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/cc0c777b99bba5ab72a8b3417a5bb0864bad51ae"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/307155b44e9121343fe05247ed206883f77a8bdd","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/307155b44e9121343fe05247ed206883f77a8bdd","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDMwNzE1NWI0NGU5MTIxMzQzZmUwNTI0N2VkMjA2ODgzZjc3YThiZGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/21800739d65fb66a9c83d2a40e8f73031f5be5ed","sha":"21800739d65fb66a9c83d2a40e8f73031f5be5ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/21800739d65fb66a9c83d2a40e8f73031f5be5ed"}],"sha":"307155b44e9121343fe05247ed206883f77a8bdd","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/307155b44e9121343fe05247ed206883f77a8bdd"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/f81ecbc4d0e883770ea34581928a50b3b163c158/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:04:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:04:45Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: tests for the chat path, deletion, the reaper, admin and sharing\n\nThe chat path: image_ids stores pictures behind a vision turn and a\ndocument-and-picture turn, never delays the answer and never fails it;\nimage_refs loads stored pictures into the inline path, shares the\nfive-picture cap and answers 422 image_ref_missing before anything starts;\nthe request snapshot keeps ids and no bytes; image_memory answers a\nfollow-up from the stored picture after its V41 row expired and after a\nrestart. Lifecycle: chat deletion removes rows and both byte stores, a\nfailed erase is counted and finished by the reaper, the reaper keeps\neverything inside the grace and only orphans after it, account deletion\ncascades, the admin route is audited and rank-checked, and a chat with\nmeta.images is private to the share policy.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"d77e4eb2f3edc37d25773f43bc03712e837fbbe9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/d77e4eb2f3edc37d25773f43bc03712e837fbbe9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/f81ecbc4d0e883770ea34581928a50b3b163c158","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/f81ecbc4d0e883770ea34581928a50b3b163c158","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKGY4MWVjYmM0ZDBlODgzNzcwZWEzNDU4MTkyOGE1MGIzYjE2M2MxNTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc","sha":"57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc"}],"sha":"f81ecbc4d0e883770ea34581928a50b3b163c158","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/f81ecbc4d0e883770ea34581928a50b3b163c158"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:00:54Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-10-02T15:00:54Z","email":"naman.jain@techsarasolutions.com","name":"naman"},"message":"chat media: store every chat picture server-side and serve it to any device\n\nNew app/chat_media.py: POST/GET /chat-media/{conversation} and\nGET /chat-media/{conversation}/{attachment_id}?size=thumb|full. Only rasters\nwhose magic bytes and a full Pillow decode agree are kept; files are written\natomically under CHAT_MEDIA_DIR before the row, and the first write wins, so\na picture''s URL never changes content and is cached privately and\nimmutably. Every refusal of someone else''s picture, or of the F034 reserved\nkey, is one 404 body.\n\n/chat stores inline pictures named by image_ids in a background task at\nintake (every route), and loads image_refs (stored pictures sent instead of\nbytes) before routing, answering 422 image_ref_missing before the stream\nwhen one cannot be loaded. image_memory falls back to the stored pictures\nwhen its process entry and V41 row are gone (IMAGE_MEMORY_STORE_FALLBACK).\nDeleting a chat erases its bytes right after the response; a reaper removes\norphans past the grace. Sharing treats meta.images as private, and super\nadmins get an audited inline route for a member''s picture.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"73976de1d2820367c350ef42116a72d90e0611ed","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/trees/73976de1d2820367c350ef42116a72d90e0611ed"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/git/commits/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/252194973?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995","id":252194973,"login":"namanjain221995","node_id":"U_kgDODwgwnQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/namanjain221995","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc","node_id":"C_kwDOTmnEa9oAKDU3YzE1YzJjOGE1ODM5Y2E3YWJiZmE5MzA4MDBmMDk3NTI3YmZmZmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commit/e07c3787e552faacf9e5761d8ec4d3127e07b143","sha":"e07c3787e552faacf9e5761d8ec4d3127e07b143","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/e07c3787e552faacf9e5761d8ec4d3127e07b143"}],"sha":"57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits/57c15c2c8a5839ca7abbfa930800f097527bfffc"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/namanjain221995/personal-LLM-Chabot/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=4fc67a6b34bc94bc6cf6fb7d64e10f855df93482&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A25%3A45.608Z"}');
