riptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/833cf64dff339616cc89792ce4bc4e8dd139846d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:49:34Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:49:34Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"feat(verify): catch links that only resolve before the installer flattens\n\nVerified the install path end to end against a scratch repo: npx skills add\nAlfred-Lau/skills discovers all 25 skills despite the three-level nesting and\ncopies each one''s sibling references, but it installs them flat as\n<agent>/skills/<name>/ — the meta/design/build/grow directories are dropped.\n\nSo a cross-category link resolves in this repo and 404s on the user''s machine.\nThat is exactly the implement-ui -> ../../meta/setup-site-skills/design-rules.md\nlink fixed earlier, and nothing would have stopped it coming back: repo-relative\nresolution passes. Simulate the flattening instead, allowing only same-directory\nand sibling-skill hops. Fault-injecting the old link fails the new check.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac4bdcf5e44899f09e23e22629b2d7ce977efcc5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/trees/ac4bdcf5e44899f09e23e22629b2d7ce977efcc5"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/commits/833cf64dff339616cc89792ce4bc4e8dd139846d","verification":{"payload":"tree ac4bdcf5e44899f09e23e22629b2d7ce977efcc5\nparent 0e554cbf9541081e08931e4471c75bc1a9da9bb7\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785304174 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785304174 +0000\n\nfeat(verify): catch links that only resolve before the installer flattens\n\nVerified the install path end to end against a scratch repo: npx skills add\nAlfred-Lau/skills discovers all 25 skills despite the three-level nesting and\ncopies each one''s sibling references, but it installs them flat as\n<agent>/skills/<name>/ — the meta/design/build/grow directories are dropped.\n\nSo a cross-category link resolves in this repo and 404s on the user''s machine.\nThat is exactly the implement-ui -> ../../meta/setup-site-skills/design-rules.md\nlink fixed earlier, and nothing would have stopped it coming back: repo-relative\nresolution passes. Simulate the flattening instead, allowing only same-directory\nand sibling-skill hops. Fault-injecting the old link fails the new check.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMS9wfZkPwGehY6I0fPAjky5w7Kcs0XeFkK2TOBNZBLbhaa4aGOlb5oJ6jDfiz5rv5\n7hcQhpqvrUXs8vW2cfgwE=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T05:49:35Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_typ