 freshly added workflow annotated every run with a Node 20 deprecation\nnotice. checkout/setup-node v7, pnpm/action-setup v6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"c45faf1375ef5da2f5c7b9d1d97ff22165407932","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/trees/c45faf1375ef5da2f5c7b9d1d97ff22165407932"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/commits/0e554cbf9541081e08931e4471c75bc1a9da9bb7","verification":{"payload":"tree c45faf1375ef5da2f5c7b9d1d97ff22165407932\nparent 52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785303847 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785303847 +0000\n\nci: bump actions off the deprecated Node 20 runtime\n\nThe freshly added workflow annotated every run with a Node 20 deprecation\nnotice. checkout/setup-node v7, pnpm/action-setup v6.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQMLL+ga+ZO1lNDr5tOvDnhRKDXLmY72bzdK6YzpI+sZsXwMfxOgWzU+i6DmQ3K9BTP\nUqpSQVftv67ZxRvOpkXQU=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T05:44:08Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/0e554cbf9541081e08931e4471c75bc1a9da9bb7","node_id":"C_kwDOTmwWq9oAKDBlNTU0Y2JmOTU0MTA4MWUwODkzMWU0NDcxYzc1YmMxYTlkYTliYjc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c","sha":"52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c"}],"sha":"0e554cbf9541081e08931e4471c75bc1a9da9bb7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/0e554cbf9541081e08931e4471c75bc1a9da9bb7"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:41:49Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:41:49Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"Merge branch ''cursor/harden-site-skills-verification-1761''\n\nMake the verification loop enforceable and the demo''s ship gate honest.\n\nThe demo proved out the flow''s plumbing but falsified three of the six\nmitigations in PLAN.md §11. This closes that gap: design rules lose their\ninline escapes and route deviations through a DIRECTION.md exceptions table,\npnpm verify turns the mechanically-detectable half of review into 13 CI-gated\nassertions, and the demo''s quality passes run for real — finding a 2.84:1\ncontrast failure, a client-shell HTML response, and a render-blocking font on\nthe LCP path.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"7e22e6ddf498adc1795a8b87bf6861e905719193","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/trees/7e22e6ddf498adc1795a8b87bf6861e905719193"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/commits/52d0024e59eec32dacf724529c97886f6ffe603c","verification":{"payload":"tree 7e22e6ddf498adc1795a8b87bf6861e905719193\nparent 4b5ee8c96b6ac952ee53697ad86182a3a45ee996\nparent 251ea365b4a98e1f36fc632d501a1ea9f5a65baa\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785303709 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785303709 +0000\n\nMerge branch ''cursor/harden-site-skills-verification-1761''\n\nMake the verification loop enforceable and the demo''s ship gate honest.\n\nThe demo proved out the flow''s plumbing but falsified three of the six\nmitigations in PLAN.md §11. This closes that gap: design rules lose their\ninline escapes and route deviations through a DIRECTION.md exceptions table,\npnpm verify turns the mechanically-detectable half of review into 13 CI-gated\nassertions, and the demo''s quality passes run for real — finding a 2.84:1\ncontrast 