,"followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/6aff71fcb16376ce1b9d6a4dad8aa6906cac71d2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:26:44Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:26:44Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"feat(flow): close the per-page loop after the tracer page\n\nThe main flow ran 1-12 straight through, so once the tracer page shipped there\nwas no route back for the rest of IA.md''s sitemap — the flow dropped you after\none page. Mark steps 7-9 as a per-page loop, have page-spec pick the next\nun-built non-deferred route, give visual-qa a three-way exit, and make\nship-checklist surface uncovered pages before running the gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"76ffd60635587c780e2b15cb93042f605aa76471","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/trees/76ffd60635587c780e2b15cb93042f605aa76471"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/commits/6aff71fcb16376ce1b9d6a4dad8aa6906cac71d2","verification":{"payload":"tree 76ffd60635587c780e2b15cb93042f605aa76471\nparent 20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785302804 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785302804 +0000\n\nfeat(flow): close the per-page loop after the tracer page\n\nThe main flow ran 1-12 straight through, so once the tracer page shipped there\nwas no route back for the rest of IA.md''s sitemap — the flow dropped you after\none page. Mark steps 7-9 as a per-page loop, have page-spec pick the next\nun-built non-deferred route, give visual-qa a three-way exit, and make\nship-checklist surface uncovered pages before running the gate.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQPnT+q3auEa2uQU9JWS6tKxYwBfjUx7x88+kYXb7/3seI6Ky4QxODIWduaF+6u5AXV\n7/hY7tC+E+zWRz8UYJ9Q4=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T05:39:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/6aff71fcb16376ce1b9d6a4dad8aa6906cac71d2","node_id":"C_kwDOTmwWq9oAKDZhZmY3MWZjYjE2Mzc2Y2UxYjlkNmE0ZGFkOGFhNjkwNmNhYzcxZDI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9","sha":"20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9"}],"sha":"6aff71fcb16376ce1b9d6a4dad8aa6906cac71d2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/6aff71fcb16376ce1b9d6a4dad8aa6906cac71d2"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/commits/20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:26:00Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T05:26:00Z","email":"cursoragent@cursor.com","name":"Cursor Agent"},"message":"feat(design-rules): make the hard rules hard and route exceptions through DIRECTION\n\nThe rules carried three inline ''unless the brand/system requires it'' escapes,\nwhich the same agent could grant itself by writing them upstream — so nothing\nindependent anchored visual QA. Restate every rule as a target behaviour per\nPLAN appendix B, drop the inline escapes, and give deviations one auditable\nhome: a Rule exceptions table in DIRECTION.md that visual-qa and\ndesign-critique read. Direction prose no longer downgrades a rule miss.\n\nAlso pin each setup template to a fixed destination filename (issue-tracker.md\nwas ambiguous between two variants), require design-rules.md to be copied\nverbatim rather than summarised, and stop templates from linking outside\ndocs/agents/ with relative paths that break once copied.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>","tree":{"sha":"ba41c674320230ff94101ed6196089ef0cb0d97a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/trees/ba41c674320230ff94101ed6196089ef0cb0d97a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/skills/git/commits/20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9","verification":{"payload":"tree ba41c674320230ff94101ed6196089ef0cb0d97a\nparent 633777ee38d118742d87cba65fb75d48992feda3\nauthor Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785302760 +0000\ncommitter Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com> 1785302760 +0000\n\nfeat(design-rules): make the hard rules hard and route exceptions through DIRECTION\n\nThe rules carried three inline ''unless the brand/system requires it'' escapes,\nwhich the same agent could grant itself by writing them upstream — so nothing\nindependent anchored visual QA. Restate every rule as a target behaviour per\nPLAN appendix B, drop the inline escapes, and give deviations one auditable\nhome: a Rule exceptions table in DIRECTION.md that visual-qa and\ndesign-critique read. Direction prose no longer downgrades a rule miss.\n\nAlso pin each setup template to a fixed destination filename (issue-tracker.md\nwas ambiguous between two variants), require design-rules.md to be copied\nverbatim rather than summarised, and stop templates from linking outside\ndocs/agents/ with relative paths that break once copied.\n\nCo-authored-by: Alfred榆关 <jian.liu@icloud.com>\n","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN SSH SIGNATURE-----\nU1NIU0lHAAAAAQAAADMAAAALc3NoLWVkMjU1MTkAAAAg+qImwGMCy/grKZ50VxRHz3VfWW\nAL3QNbzIy2Nwcn+nQAAAADZ2l0AAAAAAAAAAZzaGE1MTIAAABTAAAAC3NzaC1lZDI1NTE5\nAAAAQEkNk1Ewhy+Qu3nzuQFckn0WuvQCyBFl6z8Ip4AFbAWGBtOFLviWkkI0QBBxVhHPue\nZfM/utGUdy+mufofzYDQo=\n-----END SSH SIGNATURE-----","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T05:39:17Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/199161495?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/cursoragent","id":199161495,"login":"cursoragent","node_id":"U_kgDOC972lw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/cursoragent","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/20a2915eafda4ff1880be54b4964047099f1f9d9","node_id":"C_kwDOTmwWq9oAKDIwYTI5MTVlYWZkYTRmZjE4ODBiZTU0YjQ5NjQwNDcwOTlmMWY5ZDk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alfred-Lau/skills/commit/633777ee38d118742d87cba65fb75d48992feda3","sha":"633777ee38d118742d87cba65fb75d48992feda3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alfred-Lau/s