ored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"f56264f225435d35ebf290bf52158f5bb7ebe4d0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/trees/f56264f225435d35ebf290bf52158f5bb7ebe4d0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/commits/358a2bcd171142456400c01bce2eb1e79716b159","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/358a2bcd171142456400c01bce2eb1e79716b159","node_id":"C_kwDOTm0acdoAKDM1OGEyYmNkMTcxMTQyNDU2NDAwYzAxYmNlMmViMWU3OTcxNmIxNTk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198","sha":"18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198"}],"sha":"358a2bcd171142456400c01bce2eb1e79716b159","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/358a2bcd171142456400c01bce2eb1e79716b159"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T10:06:39Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T10:06:39Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"message":"fix(ingest): метка движка ''mock'' -> ''builtin'' (ingest не использует engine-provider)\n\ningest — служебный шаг приёма файла (проверка + конвертация в wav + пуск asr), движка у него нет. Метка ''mock'' сбивала с толку — выглядела как тестовый мок-провайдер, хотя это fallback при sm.engine=None. ''builtin'' честно показывает встроенную обработку без движка. В веб-таблице шагов колонка «Движок» для ingest теперь читается однозначно.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c5beb784220210786c4bbd47418fb827f4a960c3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/trees/c5beb784220210786c4bbd47418fb827f4a960c3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/commits/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198","node_id":"C_kwDOTm0acdoAKDE4ZWMxMjgzZWRjMjkxNzE3MTE0MmRhZDM5OTE0ZWMwOGQzZjcxOTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff","sha":"4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff"}],"sha":"18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/18ec1283edc2917171142dad39914ec08d3f7198"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T09:55:49Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T09:55:49Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"message":"fix(diarization,trace): wav-конвертация VBR-mp3 для pyannote + engine/timings в trace\n\nDiarization: pyannote на VBR/низкобитрейтном mp3 падал «requested chunk resulted in N samples instead of expected M» (mp3 frame padding -> неточный seek -> chunk-sample mismatch). _ensure_wav_16k_mono() конвертирует не-wav через системный ffmpeg в WAV 16kHz mono PCM (temp в /tmp — директория исходника может быть недоступна на запись другому uid); WAV CBR даёт точные тайминги. error-результаты НЕ кешируются — повторный запрос может ретраить. Подтверждено: job 1ebe7b4e (27_02_Peshka, 225с) -> done, final.docx.\n\nTrace: веб-таблица шагов брала данные из trace-audit /trace/steps, а _emit_trace клал engine=sm.engine (обычно None) и не клал started_at/ended_at -> engine=null, duration=null -> прочерк «Движок» и «Длит.». Фикс: 7 воркеров возвращают engine в результате; shared/worker.py фиксирует started_iso/ended_iso вокруг handler и пробрасывает engine+timings в TraceEvent. Подтверждено: trace/steps отдаёт engine (mock/deepseek/python-docx) и duration. 268 контракт-тестов + e2e зелёные, ruff чистый.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4c2bda31f6e15c3c8aaf1b79f1b22b2cc59518b0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/trees/4c2bda31f6e15c3c8aaf1b79f1b22b2cc59518b0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/commits/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff","node_id":"C_kwDOTm0acdoAKDQxMzI0MzBiMmMyZGEwMzJlMDUwOWVhOTA4Mzc2ODczYmM5OTcyZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a","sha":"be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a"}],"sha":"4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/4132430b2c2da032e0509ea908376873bc9972ff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T09:27:46Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T09:27:46Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"message":"@\nfix(diarization): идемпотентность diarize по содержимому файла + transport timeout 3600с\n\nБесконечный цикл рестартов диаризации на длинном аудио (job 238b7fb,\nрпк6-005.mp3 900с/15мин): pyannote на CPU = ~21 мин/проход, SSE-streamable-http\nтранспорт рвался раньше ответа, клиент реконнектил и слал новый CallToolRequest,\nсервер без идемпотентности запускал pyannote ЗАНОВО (65 CallToolRequest за сессию,\nответ терялся на разорванном stream). Прошлый SSE-timeout фикс (600с) покрывал\n275с, но не 900с.\n\nДва слоя фикса:\n1. diarize.py: кеш результатов _result_cache (LRU max 32) по ключу\n   sha256(контент)+sha256(params) + inflight-lock (threading.Event). Повторный\n   CallToolRequest для того же файла отдаёт cache-hit мгновенно либо (follower)\n   ждёт лидера и получает тот же результат — НИКОГДА не запускает второй pyannote.\n   Тело вычисления вынесено в _run_diarization().\n2. mcp_client.py: default timeout 600->3600, параметр timeout проброшен через\n   call_mcp_tool -> _call_mcp_tool_async -> httpx2.Timeout + read_timeout_seconds.\n\nТест: tests/contract/test_diarize_idempotency.py (4 теста: cache-hit,\ndifferent-content, different-params, concurrent-single-pipeline). 268\nконтракт-тестов зелёные, ruff чистый.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>\n@","tree":{"sha":"8c5e69606ee9e16448c07334ce3ed46c6f46a712","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/trees/8c5e69606ee9e16448c07334ce3ed46c6f46a712"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/commits/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a","node_id":"C_kwDOTm0acdoAKGJlNWZjOWU1Y2E0ZmQ5YTZjZWI3MGI5ODg4OTU4MWE4MTcwNzJlM2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commit/458a352a5dce9a27a5cae9ce4255f58274f35411","sha":"458a352a5dce9a27a5cae9ce4255f58274f35411","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/458a352a5dce9a27a5cae9ce4255f58274f35411"}],"sha":"be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/be5fc9e5ca4fd9a6ceb70b98889581a817072e3a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Alexsey111","id":150332608,"login":"Alexsey111","node_id":"U_kgDOCPXkwA","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/commits/458a352a5dce9a27a5cae9ce4255f58274f35411/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:14:08Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T08:14:08Z","email":"Alexsey111@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Alexsey111"},"message":"fix(mcp_client): SSE-stream timeout for long MCP tools (diarization on CPU)\n\nДолгие MCP-tool (pyannote диаризация 275с аудио на CPU = минуты) падали с\n''MCPError: SSE stream ended without a response'': сервер успешно диаризовал,\nно ответ не доходил до клиента — дефолтный httpx-клиент streamable_http_client\nимеет короткий транспортный timeout, а read_timeout_seconds в call_tool покрывал\nтолько MCP-уровень. Фикс: передаём http_client=httpx2.AsyncClient(timeout=\nTimeout(timeout, connect=10s)) с большим read-timeout (httpx2 — то, что\nиспользует MCP SDK 2.0). Подтверждено end-to-end на 275с аудио: diarization ok,\nполный пайплайн done.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"60ec064bc8ec5994ebd395442ae407c3322a91e0","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/trees/60ec064bc8ec5994ebd395442ae407c3322a91e0"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Alexsey111/transcription_service/git/commits/458a352a5dce9a27a5cae9ce4255f58274f35411","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/150332608?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Alexsey111/gists{/gist_id}","gra