ed Tarek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-07T08:59:01Z","email":"AhmedTarekOfficial@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ahmed Tarek"},"message":"Harden AI engine against silent unavailability: fast-fail on missing key + refresh fallback chain\n\nThe \"Assistant Unavailable\" status kept recurring because two failure modes\ngave no diagnostic signal: (1) dist/ was built before the previous fix, so the\nbundle had an empty API key baked in (Vite inlines VITE_* at build time) and\nevery AI request 401''d through the whole fallback chain with no explanation;\n(2) the z-ai/glm-5.2:free fallback slug now returns 404 (free tier withdrawn),\nadding a wasted round-trip. checkHealth() and executeWithFallback() now\nfast-fail with an actionable message when no key is baked into the build, and\nthe fallback list is reordered with models verified live against OpenRouter\non 2026-09-07 (dead slug removed).\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"7fe539f171a32ff7a0e5c908c110d5f476c05453","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/git/trees/7fe539f171a32ff7a0e5c908c110d5f476c05453"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/git/commits/02342df3b24d649cf4c5854375186c573958f092","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155250045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTarekOfficial","id":155250045,"login":"AhmedTarekOfficial","node_id":"U_kgDOCUDtfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/commit/02342df3b24d649cf4c5854375186c573958f092","node_id":"C_kwDOTm5-PtoAKDAyMzQyZGYzYjI0ZDY0OWNmNGM1ODU0Mzc1MTg2YzU3Mzk1OGYwOTI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/commit/80a0adf84ed0d297f76416d833c6ca9eaa4d7428","sha":"80a0adf84ed0d297f76416d833c6ca9eaa4d7428","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/commits/80a0adf84ed0d297f76416d833c6ca9eaa4d7428"}],"sha":"02342df3b24d649cf4c5854375186c573958f092","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/commits/02342df3b24d649cf4c5854375186c573958f092"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155250045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/AhmedTarekOfficial","id":155250045,"login":"AhmedTarekOfficial","node_id":"U_kgDOCUDtfQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/commits/80a0adf84ed0d297f76416d833c6ca9eaa4d7428/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:59:57Z","email":"AhmedTarekOfficial@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ahmed Tarek"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T14:59:57Z","email":"AhmedTarekOfficial@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Ahmed Tarek"},"message":"Fix AI model availability: live model IDs + production OpenRouter proxy\n\nThe AI engine reported \"unavailable\" even with a valid OpenRouter key\nbecause the configured model slugs (meta-llama/llama-3.3-70b-instruct:free,\ngoogle/gemma-2-27b-it:free and most of the fallback chain) no longer exist\non OpenRouter. Point the primary/fallback defaults and the fallback chain at\ncurrently-live :free models, and add an /api/openrouter proxy to the Express\nserver so production (which lacks Vite''s dev-only proxy) can actually reach\nOpenRouter instead of 404ing every AI call.\n\n🤖 Generated with Codebuff\nCo-Authored-By: Codebuff <noreply@codebuff.com>","tree":{"sha":"c6f0b73a1a649ae77488c541fa7bb846b1e49b63","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/git/trees/c6f0b73a1a649ae77488c541fa7bb846b1e49b63"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/AhmedTarekOfficial/Ai-content-operational-/git/commits/80a0adf84ed0d297f76416d833c6ca9eaa4d7428","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/155250045?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AhmedTarekOfficial/followers","following_