wari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/b83ddea98725ecdba29c2c934023b6c11a63da4b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:33:57Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-24T09:33:57Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: proxy WebSocket upgrade headers for /ws/analytics in nginx\n\nnginx''s only location block never forwarded the Upgrade/Connection\nheaders, so a client''s WS handshake to /ws/analytics reached the\nbackend as a plain HTTP request and Starlette''s websocket-only route\ndidn''t match it -- confirmed live: the browser saw the connection die\nwith close code 1006 instead of establishing a session, and the\nadvertised \"live updates over /ws/analytics\" feature never actually\nworked in production.\n\nAdd the standard nginx map for Connection: upgrade (scoped to actual\nWS handshakes so ordinary HTTP keep-alive is untouched), and raise\nproxy_read_timeout for this location from 60s to 1h since a push-only\nWS connection is meant to stay open far longer than a normal request.\n\nNote: the deploy workflow only pulls the backend and restarts the app\nservice -- it never re-applies deploy/nginx.conf. This fix needs to be\nmanually copied to /etc/nginx/sites-available/railsphere on the EC2\nbox and nginx reloaded before it takes effect in production.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"87ca69c9f0e2bb0b4fd708ac731df157d02df7c4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/87ca69c9f0e2bb0b4fd708ac731df157d02df7c4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/b83ddea98725ecdba29c2c934023b6c11a63da4b","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/b83ddea98725ecdba29c2c934023b6c11a63da4b","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGI4M2RkZWE5ODcyNWVjZGJhMjljMmM5MzQwMjNiNmMxMWE2M2RhNGI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3","sha":"31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3"}],"sha":"b83ddea98725ecdba29c2c934023b6c11a63da4b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/b83ddea98725ecdba29c2c934023b6c11a63da4b"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:33:27Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:33:27Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: gate reference-data writes behind an admin flag\n\n/stations, /trains, /routes, and /route-stations had no authentication\nat all on their POST/PUT/PATCH/DELETE endpoints -- get_current_user\nnever appeared in any of the three route files. Anyone on the internet\ncould create, edit, or delete the entire train network on the live\ninstance.\n\n- Add users.is_admin (migration bde6a457fcf1), defaulting to false.\n  No bootstrap admin is created by the migration on purpose -- promote\n  one after the fact with scripts/promote_admin.py.\n- Add require_admin (app/api/dependencies.py), layered on top of\n  get_current_user: 401 if not logged in, 403 if logged in but not an\n  admin.\n- Gate every mutating endpoint in station.py, train.py, route.py, and\n  route_station.py behind it. Read endpoints are untouched and still\n  public.\n- Expose is_admin on UserResponse so a client can tell.\n- Add an admin_headers fixture (conftest.py) that registers a user and\n  promotes it directly on the test session, and thread it through\n  every test that was previously creating stations/trains/routes/\n  route-stations without auth.\n\nChecked before making this change: the Vercel frontend never calls any\nof these write endpoints, so this doesn''t change what the live app\ndoes -- only what an unauthenticated caller hitting the API directly\ncan do.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EWGx1g7QBvtVApxswoZ8yK","tree":{"sha":"67f210c33c34d44360ea945d9d3a9caea3fe7daa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/67f210c33c34d44360ea945d9d3a9caea3fe7daa"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDMxZTg2NTA2MjM1Y2QzYzQyNmQ2YjY4MTNkYTRhNDc2NThiNzNiZDM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa","sha":"aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa"}],"sha":"31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/31e86506235cd3c426d6b6813da4a47658b73bd3"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:08:59Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-08T07:08:59Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: don''t 500 on malformed JWT sub, stop leaking a real password in test config\n\nget_current_user converted the token''s sub to int() outside the try/\nexcept, so a token with a non-numeric sub raised an uncaught ValueError\nand fell through to a generic 500 instead of a 401. Moved it inside the\ntry block.\n\nAlso replace the hardcoded local Postgres password in conftest.py''s\ndefault DATABASE_URL with the generic postgres/postgres placeholder CI\nalready uses, instead of committing what looks like a real credential.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EWGx1g7QBvtVApxswoZ8yK","tree":{"sha":"e00820ff8e1553fd481dde2812506a0b630b6aa3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/e00820ff8e1553fd481dde2812506a0b630b6aa3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGFlZDM0MGMzZjM0ZTc1YzMxOTZhODBkMjNjM2E4MmJkZTQwNGRiYWE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/8ba6cf0c081975e8e817404d626a94fb0be4571c","sha":"8ba6cf0c081975e8e817404d626a94fb0be4571c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8ba6cf0c081975e8e817404d626a94fb0be4571c"}],"sha":"aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/aed340c3f34e75c3196a80d23c3a82bde404dbaa"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8ba6cf0c081975e8e817404d626a94fb0be4571c/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:18:55Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-05T13:18:55Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: remove hardcoded DATA_ENCRYPTION_KEY from tracked files\n\nGitGuardian flagged a Generic Encryption Key committed in docker-compose.yml\nand .github/workflows/ci.yml, and duplicated in backend/tests/conftest.py.\nNone of these keys were ever used against real/production data (the\nproduction key is set via an untracked env file on the EC2 host, per\nconfig.py''s empty default), so no rotation is needed -- but a valid Fernet\nkey shouldn''t sit in git history regardless.\n\n- CI now generates an ephemeral key per run instead of using a fixed one\n- conftest.py generates a fresh key per test run instead of a fixed one\n- docker-compose.yml now reads the key from a git-ignored root .env file,\n  with README instructions to generate one on first clone\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01MpFv55QtVJNhW8E8Yw5Rss","tree":{"sha":"e95540c26e44d0170f680940f168ed12339c6878","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/e95540c26e44d0170f680940f168ed12339c6878"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/8ba6cf0c081975e8e817404d626a94fb0be4571c","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com