hantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/e00884219aade6235c9fcc6d56dd8110fe608c7a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:54:27Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:54:27Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add automated database backup script\n\npg_dump -> gzip -> local disk (backend/backups/), with retention\npruning (default 7 days). Local-disk only for now, not off-instance --\nprotects against a bad migration or accidental DELETE (restore\nwithout needing the instance to survive), not against loss of the\ninstance/EBS volume itself. Upgrading to S3 later is just swapping the\nwrite target; the dump/prune logic stays the same.\n\nScheduled via deploy/railsphere-backup.service + .timer (added next).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"53cae13bbe154f9077b2f869ba7620ef822832b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/53cae13bbe154f9077b2f869ba7620ef822832b1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/e00884219aade6235c9fcc6d56dd8110fe608c7a","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/e00884219aade6235c9fcc6d56dd8110fe608c7a","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGUwMDg4NDIxOWFhZGU2MjM1YzlmY2M2ZDU2ZGQ4MTEwZmU2MDhjN2E","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d","sha":"5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d"}],"sha":"e00884219aade6235c9fcc6d56dd8110fe608c7a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/e00884219aade6235c9fcc6d56dd8110fe608c7a"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:45:26Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:45:26Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"perf: add ETag + Cache-Control to read-only GET endpoints\n\nApplies to /stations, /trains, /routes, /route-stations, /journeys\n(60s) and /analytics (300s, matching the existing Redis TTL for that\ndata) -- auth, mutations, websockets, and GraphQL are untouched.\nConditional requests with a matching If-None-Match get a 304 with an\nempty body instead of the full payload. This is a client/CDN-side\nsaving on top of the existing server-side Redis cache, not a\nreplacement for it -- it saves the response transfer itself.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b7cfe3a67ccc28d1eeee92c93edab18e208a54f4","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/b7cfe3a67ccc28d1eeee92c93edab18e208a54f4"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDU4MDg2MTVlMjIzM2JjOWUxODIxNzI2YTEyNzhmNGVkMTVmMjQ2MGQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791","sha":"7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791"}],"sha":"5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/5808615e2233bc9e1821726a1278f4ed15f2460d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:41:44Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:41:44Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"perf: tune SQLAlchemy connection pool, enable nginx gzip for JSON\n\nConnection pool: no explicit sizing meant SQLAlchemy''s defaults\n(pool_size=5, max_overflow=10) applied per engine, and there''s one\nengine per process -- 2 gunicorn workers + 1 arq worker in production\n-- so worst case was 45 connections against a t3.micro running\nPostgres natively on the same 1GB of RAM. Sized down to 3+2=5 per\nengine (15 total worst case) and added pool_recycle. Configurable via\nDB_POOL_* env vars.\n\nnginx: gzip was nominally \"on\" globally but gzip_types was commented\nout, defaulting to just text/html -- every JSON response from this\nAPI was going out uncompressed. Verified before/after on production:\n8532 bytes -> 1932 bytes on the wire for /stations (77% smaller).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"94d6ff95be2a21daeb8dd645c2566a9b1d25da05","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/94d6ff95be2a21daeb8dd645c2566a9b1d25da05"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDdhODA0MWUzOTRiYzYwYWY0OGM0ODc4Njk2ZjlhMzAwNmQ0NTU3OTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769","sha":"a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769"}],"sha":"7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/7a8041e394bc60af48c4878696f9a3006d455791"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:23:56Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:23:56Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: replace framer-motion page transition with CSS animation\n\nRemoving mode=\"wait\" (previous commit) didn''t fully fix it -- content\nwas still landing at a random stuck opacity (e.g. 0.23, then 0.88 on\na different navigation) instead of completing to 1, meaning framer-\nmotion''s animation loop itself was intermittently failing to finish\nin the deployed production build, not just a mode=\"wait\" deadlock.\n\nSince PageTransition wraps every single route, a JS-animation bug\nhere makes the entire app randomly appear blank on navigation. Swapped\nto tw-animate-css (already a dependency, already imported in\nindex.css) for a pure CSS keyframe fade -- no JS RAF loop to get\nstuck, so this class of failure isn''t possible.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2f1227806c6f6504680371ccf2a8eb7d3621f607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/2f1227806c6f6504680371ccf2a8eb7d3621f607"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGE1YzRiODU1NjJkYWU5MmU3MTI3NDBjNWUyZDFmYTg0NjA4NDc3Njk","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51","sha":"2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51"}],"sha":"a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/a5c4b85562dae92e712740c5e2d1fa8460847769"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:19:43Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:19:43Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: page content stuck invisible mid-fade on route change\n\nAnimatePresence mode=\"wait\" blocks the entering page''s animation\nuntil the previous page''s exit animation fully resolves. On the\ndeployed production build (React 19), that exit never resolved --\nevery route past the first page load rendered with real data in the\nDOM but stuck at ~23% opacity indefinitely, effectively invisible.\nReproduced on live Vercel deploy: clicking into a station, or any\nin-app navigation, left the page looking blank despite the API calls\nsucceeding and content actually being in the DOM.\n\nDropped mode=\"wait\" (default overlapping enter/exit) and the exit\nanimation, since without mode=\"wait\" there''s nothing coordinating it\nwith the unmount. Verified the fix removes the stuck-opacity state.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"5184adc54cdfaa252ab09533887a8a954157b6f8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/5184adc54cdfaa252ab09533887a8a954157b6f8"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDI3NzhjNDBlMDEyODA1Yzc2NjA3MGYxNTcwNmEwZjUxOGE5ZTJlNTE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc","sha":"8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc"}],"sha":"2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/2778c40e012805c766070f15706a0f518a9e2e51"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:14:37Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-22T17:14:37Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"fix: add SPA fallback rewrite for Vercel frontend deploy\n\nDirect navigation to any client-side route (e.g. /stations) returned\nVercel''s own 404 -- there''s no actual file at that path, and without\na rewrite rule Vercel never falls back to index.html for React Router\nto handle it. Verified: /stations 404''d on direct load before this.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e6199f0a4ab124dcb79863b51d237d16be4450ff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/e6199f0a4ab124dcb79863b51d237d16be4450ff"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/8078b672ee122845c4a491d2adcd2399766be7fc","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDgwNzhiNjcyZWUxMjI4NDVjNGE0OT