ers/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/ca1139205b634db21b442b102265141b2fa998c4/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:23:20Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-21T08:23:20Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add circuit breaker around Redis cache calls\n\nCache-aside was already fail-open, but every request still paid a full\nconnection-timeout on each cache call while Redis was unreachable.\nTrips open after 5 consecutive failures and fails fast for 30s before\na half-open trial call, closing again on success.\n\npybreaker''s call_async is legacy Tornado-based and breaks without\ntornado installed, so this is a small hand-rolled async breaker\ninstead of that dependency.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"ac14db4d792338392a24e57a6df08054d8da5360","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/ac14db4d792338392a24e57a6df08054d8da5360"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/ca1139205b634db21b442b102265141b2fa998c4","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.