m/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/3db37900a17e3c64e02f52fe5e846a65afa7e478/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:50:56Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:50:56Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add arq background worker to schedule analytics view refresh\n\n- app/worker.py: arq WorkerSettings with a cron job that refreshes\n  mv_top_stations/mv_top_routes every 30 minutes. Falls back to arq''s\n  default (localhost) RedisSettings when REDIS_URL is unset, so\n  importing the module never fails -- only actually running the\n  worker (`arq app.worker.WorkerSettings`) requires Redis to be\n  reachable.\n- deploy/railsphere-worker.service: systemd unit for the worker,\n  mirroring the existing gunicorn service. Not enabled on the live\n  EC2 instance yet -- deploying it is a separate, explicit step.\n- .env.example documents REDIS_URL and what runs without it.\n- tests/test_worker.py calls the job function directly against real\n  committed data (its own AsyncSessionLocal session, cleaned up\n  after) rather than the usual rollback-based fixtures, since the\n  job intentionally uses a separate connection from the request-\n  scoped test session -- exactly like the real worker process would.\n\nVerified alembic upgrade head applies cleanly to a brand-new empty\ndatabase (matching what CI''s fresh postgres:16 container will run).","tree":{"sha":"362cff12d828f585bb7722ccefd7e111fc7514f6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/362cff12d828f585bb7722ccefd7e111fc7514f6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/3db37900a17e3c64e02f52fe5e846a65afa7e478","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/3db37900a17e3c64e02f52fe5e846a65afa7e478","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDNkYjM3OTAwYTE3ZTNjNjRlMDJmNTJmZTVlODQ2YTY1YWZhN2U0Nzg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d","sha":"41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d"}],"sha":"3db37900a17e3c64e02f52fe5e846a65afa7e478","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/3db37900a17e3c64e02f52fe5e846a65afa7e478"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:47:49Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:47:49Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add Redis cache-aside layer for hot read paths\n\n- app/core/cache.py: thin Cache wrapper around an optional\n  redis.asyncio client. Every method fails open -- with REDIS_URL\n  unset, or if Redis is unreachable, get_json() returns a miss and\n  set_json()/delete() are silent no-ops, so caching never becomes a\n  hard dependency for the app to function.\n- station/train \"get by id\" now check the cache first and populate it\n  on miss (10 min TTL); update/delete invalidate the entry so stale\n  data can''t outlive a write.\n- analytics overview and train-type distribution are cached for 5\n  minutes -- both are full-table-scan aggregates that don''t need to\n  be recomputed on every request.\n- tests/test_caching.py uses fakeredis (via a new `cached_client`\n  fixture) to genuinely exercise cache hit/invalidation behavior --\n  proves a stale DB write is masked by the cache until a real update\n  invalidates it, rather than just asserting no crash. Every other\n  existing test keeps using the no-op cache so caching can''t\n  introduce staleness-related flakiness elsewhere in the suite.\n\nREDIS_URL is unset in this environment (no local Redis), so caching\ncurrently no-ops in dev; verified live against the running server\nthat both the cached and uncached paths behave correctly.","tree":{"sha":"1e1ead3db65aad8da1409587d72e1044b971c468","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/1e1ead3db65aad8da1409587d72e1044b971c468"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDQxY2ZhZWVhMDQyMDFhMGQ5NWY3OTAwMTAyYzgzZDQ0ZmYxNWY3NmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d","sha":"bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d"}],"sha":"41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/41cfaeea04201a0d95f7900102c83d44ff15f76d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:40:44Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:40:44Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: serve top-stations/top-routes from materialized views\n\nPreviously every /analytics/top-stations and /analytics/top-routes\nrequest ran a live JOIN + GROUP BY + ORDER BY over route_stations\n(415k+ rows). Both are now precomputed into mv_top_stations and\nmv_top_routes, refreshed via REFRESH MATERIALIZED VIEW CONCURRENTLY\n(needs the unique indexes the migration also creates).\n\n- alembic migration creates both views, populated immediately\n- AnalyticsRepository.refresh_views() does the refresh; exposed via\n  scripts/refresh_analytics_views.py for a manual/one-off run, and\n  will be wired into the arq worker as a scheduled job next\n- tests updated to call refresh_views() after inserting data, since\n  the views no longer update live -- one new test documents that\n  staleness explicitly (data invisible before refresh, visible after)","tree":{"sha":"898cf08c1d29c0aad79c04c224e303da3dbf122a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/898cf08c1d29c0aad79c04c224e303da3dbf122a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGJjZWY5ZmZlNGEwZjE3YjkyOTRiNDVmYjI2ZDc0YzE3MGY4YjQ4MmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/816702eb4822d0c414ba38768c324cdf61565334","sha":"816702eb4822d0c414ba38768c324cdf61565334","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/816702eb4822d0c414ba38768c324cdf61565334"}],"sha":"bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/bcef9ffe4a0f17b9294b45fb26d74c170f8b482d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/816702eb4822d0c414ba38768c324cdf61565334/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:36:59Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:36:59Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add trigram search indexes and similarity ranking\n\n- Alembic migration enables pg_trgm and adds GIN trigram indexes on\n  stations(name, code, city) and trains(train_name, train_number).\n  Accelerates the existing ILIKE ''%term%'' search filters, which\n  can''t use a plain btree index.\n- station/train repositories now order search results by\n  similarity() (best match first) instead of primary key, so e.g.\n  searching \"kanpur\" surfaces KANPUR CENTRAL ahead of a station whose\n  city merely contains the substring. Falls back to the previous\n  ordering when no search term is given.","tree":{"sha":"b9c128db574e4f73522801aba9756837f98e1b93","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/b9c128db574e4f73522801aba9756837f98e1b93"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/816702eb4822d0c414ba38768c324cdf61565334","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","f