,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/4d69ddf041ce3d5bbdb4e8a7d47486163c7687fd/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:34:43Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-20T16:34:43Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add request-id tracing and per-IP rate limiting\n\n- app/core/request_context.py: contextvar-based request id, generated\n  or forwarded from X-Request-ID, injected into every log line and\n  echoed back in the response header so a single request''s log lines\n  can be grepped out of production logs\n- app/core/rate_limit.py + main.py: slowapi-based limiter, 200/min\n  default per IP, tightened to 5/min on /auth/login and /auth/register\n  to blunt brute-force attempts\n- tests/conftest.py: disable the limiter in tests (its storage is\n  in-memory and process-wide, so test volume alone could otherwise\n  start tripping 429s); tests/test_rate_limiting.py re-enables it for\n  a focused check\n- requirements.txt: add redis and arq, used by upcoming caching and\n  background-job work","tree":{"sha":"bc547f06425e63cef3593515affe4de260928d65","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/bc547f06425e63cef3593515affe4de260928d65"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/4d69ddf041ce3d5bbdb4e8a