ari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/a927db8e2fa97e73606fbf1807d3e1e2b55bbd96/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:10:16Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:10:16Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add network analytics endpoints (real aggregate queries only)\n\nGET /analytics/overview, /top-stations, /top-routes, /train-types --\nall computed live from the actual database (counts, avg stations per\nroute, stations ranked by route count, routes ranked by stop count,\ntrain type distribution). Nothing here is fabricated or hardcoded;\nevery number is a real aggregate query. Verified against production\ndata: Kanpur Central serves 298 routes (most-connected station),\nKanniyakumari-Dibrugarh Vivek Express has 689 stops (longest route),\navg 79.86 stations per route across 5,209 routes.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"4673081fc2163a3a138d1ea6d43f1b7483c54f7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/4673081fc2163a3a138d1ea6d43f1b7483c54f7f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/a927db8e2fa97e73606fbf1807d3e1e2b55bbd96","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/u