ithub.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/976a178fafbe01bee67f3c9f466764d01f5e8fa8/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:10:06Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T07:10:06Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add routes-for-station and trains-for-station endpoints\n\nGET /stations/{id}/routes and GET /stations/{id}/trains -- for the\nstation detail page in the frontend redesign (\"trains at this\nstation\", \"routes through this station\"). Both are straightforward\njoins over existing tables (route_stations -> routes, and\nroute_stations -> routes -> schedules -> trains), 404 if the station\ndoesn''t exist. No new tables, no fabricated data.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"e73e042b61beb9659978cce98da8a6de8403fdb6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/e73e042b61beb9659978cce98da8a6de8403fdb6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/976a178fafbe01bee67f3c9f466764d01f5e8fa8","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/976a178fafbe01bee67f3c9f466764d01f5e8fa8","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDk3NmExNzhmYWZiZTAxYmVlNjdmM2M5ZjQ2Njc2NGQwMWY1ZThmYTg","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e","sha":"8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e"}],"sha":"976a178fafbe01bee67f3c9f466764d01f5e8fa8","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/976a178fafbe01bee67f3c9f466764d01f5e8fa8"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:11:36Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:11:36Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add journey search between two stations\n\nGET /journeys/search?from_station_id=&to_station_id= -- finds trains\nwhose route passes through the origin and then, later in that route''s\nsequence, through the destination, using only data that already exists\n(route_stations + schedules), joined via a self-join on route_stations\n(alias rs_from/rs_to, same route_id, rs_to.sequence_number >\nrs_from.sequence_number) then into schedules/trains. This is the \"search\ntrains from A to B\" feature a railway frontend actually needs -- the\nprevious /journeys endpoint just listed every train+schedule flat, with\nno way to query by origin/destination at all.\n\nRejects from_station_id == to_station_id with a 400. Tested against\nreal data (Jammu Tawi -> Udhampur returns 8 real trains, correctly\nsorted by departure time) and via a new test that inserts a schedule\ndirectly (there''s no POST /schedules endpoint -- schedules only come\nfrom the importer) to verify the full positive-result path, not just\nthe empty-result case.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"fd2b1f9933b2b609fd08bf5ad457548b08c53197","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/fd2b1f9933b2b609fd08bf5ad457548b08c53197"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDgxMzkzMjBmNzkxZGRkZWUwODg4ZTg3MGUyZDVkODlkYmFkYWI4MGU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5","sha":"dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5"}],"sha":"8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/8139320f791dddee0888e870e2d5d89dbadab80e"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:11:24Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:11:24Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add pagination and search to station/train/route/route-station list endpoints\n\nGET /stations, /trains, /routes, and /route-stations (unfiltered)\npreviously returned every row with no limit -- fine at small scale,\na real problem for route_stations specifically (415,996 rows in one\nresponse). Added skip/limit/search query params backed by a shared\nPaginatedResponse[T] wrapper, and a route_id filter on /route-stations\nthat returns the full ordered stop list for one route unpaginated\n(a route has at most a few dozen stops, no pagination needed there).\n\nThis is prep for the frontend: a station/train/route picker needs\nsearch-as-you-type against something other than \"fetch all 8,988\nstations client-side.\"\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"c625417a7e28203c927b9a842798a3bde94958d1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/c625417a7e28203c927b9a842798a3bde94958d1"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGRjNTg4NGNlY2I5ZDAwYWEyZTQwOGRkMDA2YWY0Yzg1MDU0MGY1YzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835","sha":"3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835"}],"sha":"dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/dc5884cecb9d00aa2e408dd006af4c850540f5c5"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:05:20Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T06:05:20Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add HTTPS via Let''s Encrypt (nip.io, no domain purchase needed)\n\nserver_name changed from the catch-all \"_\" to 16-176-230-154.nip.io --\nrequired for certbot''s nginx plugin to find and patch the right server\nblock. Live cert obtained and installed on EC2 via\n\"certbot --nginx -d 16-176-230-154.nip.io\", HTTP now redirects to\nHTTPS (certbot-managed block, not reflected in this file since it\nlives only in the deployed /etc/nginx/sites-enabled/railsphere).\nAuto-renewal via certbot.timer confirmed active.\n\nnip.io provides free wildcard DNS resolving <ip-with-dashes>.nip.io to\nthat IP, which is enough for Let''s Encrypt''s domain validation without\nowning a real domain. Tradeoff: this breaks if the EC2 instance''s\npublic IP ever changes (e.g. stop/start without an Elastic IP).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"52803853528b63bae7661aac66438ad83907e4b6","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/52803853528b63bae7661aac66438ad83907e4b6"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDNiZDBlYzUzNDI2MDk2OTE0NDI0ZmE3ZjI0MzRkNDk0MDc4OGI4MzU","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/fd8c51e9466b5276b5168b82490cc3db35b3c642","sha":"fd8c51e9466b5276b5168b82490cc3db35b3c642","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/fd8c51e9466b5276b5168b82490cc3db35b3c642"}],"sha":"3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/3bd0ec53426096914424fa7f2434d4940788b835"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/fd8c51e9466b5276b5168b82490cc3db35b3c642/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:49:24Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:49:24Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"docs: rewrite README and fill in architecture.md to match actual state\n\nThe old README claimed Redis, Celery, Docker, ticket booking, seat\nallocation, waitlist, and payments -- none of which exist in this\ncodebase; they were aspirational placeholders from the initial\nscaffold. Rewrote it to describe what''s actually here: the real data\nmodel, the real deployment (EC2 + systemd + gunicorn + nginx, no\ncontainers), how to actually run this on Windows (python run.py, not\nthe previously-documented uvicorn command which never worked), how to\nrun the test suite, and an honest roadmap section.\n\ndocs/architecture.md was empty; filled in with the request-flow\nlayering, data model (including why route_stations and schedules both\nnow have real unique constraints), the import pipeline, the migration\nhistory''s backstory, and the current deployment topology.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"b741099c24862c790e3bb8ddc4742abba1cf9c78","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/b741099c24862c790e3bb8ddc4742abba1cf9c78"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/fd8c51e9466b5276b5168b82490cc3db35b3c642","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwa