/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/12a6ab853a39f04b4b8e8fc5480f92bd5ba5479f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:48:02Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:48:02Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"ci: add GitHub Actions workflow to run the test suite\n\nRuns on push/PR to main: spins up a postgres:16 service container,\ninstalls requirements-dev.txt, runs alembic migrations against it,\nthen runs pytest. Mirrors the same DATABASE_URL/settings shape used\nlocally and in tests/conftest.py''s safety guard (refuses to run\nagainst anything other than a railsphere_test database).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"9cf7f0cbd9c494c6b1553501e618d63ff5e16ab9","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/9cf7f0cbd9c494c6b1553501e618d63ff5e16ab9"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/12a6ab853a39f04b4b8e8fc5480f92bd5ba5479f","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/12a6ab853a39f04b4b8e8fc5480f92bd5ba5479f","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDEyYTZhYjg1M2EzOWYwNGI0YjhlOGZjNTQ4MGY5MmJkNWJhNTQ3OWY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab","sha":"b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab"}],"sha":"12a6ab853a39f04b4b8e8fc5480f92bd5ba5479f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/12a6ab853a39f04b4b8e8fc5480f92bd5ba5479f"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:47:06Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:47:06Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"test: add pytest suite with isolated per-test transactions\n\nAdds a real test harness rather than no tests at all:\n- tests/conftest.py: dedicated railsphere_test database, each test\n  runs inside an outer DB transaction rolled back afterward\n  (join_transaction_mode=\"create_savepoint\" so the app''s own\n  session.commit() calls become savepoints instead of ending the\n  outer transaction) -- verified zero rows leak between runs.\n- FastAPI''s get_db dependency is overridden per-test to use the\n  transactional session; httpx''s ASGITransport drives requests\n  in-process, no real server needed.\n- 15 tests across health, auth (register/login/duplicate-email/bad\n  password/missing token), stations (CRUD + duplicate code), and\n  route-stations (including regression coverage for the duplicate\n  route-station and duplicate-sequence-number bugs fixed earlier this\n  session).\n\nrequirements-dev.txt separates test tooling (pytest, pytest-asyncio,\nhttpx) from the production requirements.txt so it isn''t installed on\ndeploy targets.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"be5483554560f20065b46b8212f4011fb502a98a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/be5483554560f20065b46b8212f4011fb502a98a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKGI5YWQxZDY4M2Q3Y2JhZTA4YjFjNTQ3MDY0MjY5MWMzNjYzYjczYWI","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf","sha":"4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf"}],"sha":"b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/b9ad1d683d7cbae08b1c5470642691c3663b73ab"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:42:49Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:42:49Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add structured logging and a global unhandled-exception handler\n\nPreviously there was zero structured logging in the application code\n(only print() in the importers, which is fine for a CLI tool but not\nfor a running service). Adds app/core/logging_config.py (consistent\nformatter, level driven by DEBUG) and a global FastAPI exception\nhandler that logs unhandled exceptions with full context before\nreturning a generic 500 -- verified this doesn''t shadow FastAPI''s own\nHTTPException handling (404s/400s/etc. still return their real status\ncodes, only truly unhandled exceptions hit the new handler).\n\nAlso turned off the engine''s echo=True, which was installing its own\nhandler on the sqlalchemy.engine logger and double-printing every SQL\nstatement once logging_config.py''s handler was added; SQL logging is\nnow controlled entirely through the logger, same as everything else.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"7894771c9d7441d25bae324afe58bfd25a1b799c","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/trees/7894771c9d7441d25bae324afe58bfd25a1b799c"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/git/commits/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf","node_id":"C_kwDOTnLEU9oAKDRjNDY3YjE1NmNhZDhjMjEyNGFiYTYzODlhODE0NTQ5NTAwZDdhZGY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commit/62266baeda4a014234baf57582add1f404d62f77","sha":"62266baeda4a014234baf57582add1f404d62f77","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/62266baeda4a014234baf57582add1f404d62f77"}],"sha":"4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/4c467b156cad8c2124aba6389a814549500d7adf"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/145037553?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/rohantiwari9573","id":145037553,"login":"rohantiwari9573","node_id":"U_kgDOCKUY8Q","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/rohantiwari9573","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/rohantiwari9573/railsphere-backend/commits/62266baeda4a014234baf57582add1f404d62f77/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:38:57Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-08-19T05:38:57Z","email":"rohantiwari166@gmail.com","name":"Rohan"},"message":"feat: add nginx reverse proxy config\n\nProxies port 80 to the gunicorn service on 127.0.0.1:8000, forwarding\nthe standard X-Forwarded-* headers uvicorn''s ProxyHeadersMiddleware\nexpects. HTTPS/TLS is not configured here -- that needs a real domain\npointed at the instance first (tracked separately).\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"6947670442a680f5982f460fc5231eb0e3e442db","url":"ht