er shared a social-media infographic naming Docker Compose as its own\ntopic. Confirmed a real gap via grep: this repo''s practice labs already\nrun 16 real docker-compose.yml files, but no chapter ever taught what\nthe file does -- container-image-internals.md mentions \"docker-compose\nup\" once, in passing.\n\nAdds a real, reproducible demo (practice/docker-compose-multi-service-\norchestration/) proving depends_on''s real limitation on a genuinely\nfresh Postgres volume: plain depends_on only waits for the container to\nstart, not for Postgres to finish initdb, producing a real captured\n\"Connection refused\". A healthcheck plus condition: service_healthy\nfixes it -- re-run twice with identical results.\n\nAlso fixes a self-caused gap: flashcards/README.md''s dated note-chain\nhad silently skipped the previous day''s T-2427 deck entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"dc5e9f5e963e1c1640e8c900eb980e2359a9ff23","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuanMelendres/cracking-code-interviews/git/trees/dc5e9f5e963e1c1640e8c900eb980e2359a9ff23"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuanMelendres/cracking-code-interviews/git/commits/d31d8035471bacdd0865775004cf4c2d382b21a4","verification":{"payload":"tree dc5e9f5e963e1c1640e8c900eb980e2359a9ff23\nparent 8eeadfa4403901ab1bfd0e18a625e4901e8099eb\nauthor Juan Antonio Melendres Villa <juan.mele97@gmail.com> 1790202241 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790202241 -0600\n\nfeat: add Docker Compose Multi-Service Orchestration chapter (T-2428) (#151)\n\nUser shared a social-media infographic naming Docker Compose as its own\ntopic. Confirmed a real gap via grep: this repo''s practice labs already\nrun 16 real docker-compose.yml files, but no chapter ever taught what\nthe file does -- container-image-internals.md mentions \"docker-compose\nup\" once, in passing.\n\nAdds a real, reproducible demo (practice/docker-compose-multi-service-\norchestration/) proving depends_on''s real limitation on a genuinely\nfresh Postgres volume: plain depends_on only waits for the container to\nstart, not for Postgres to finish initdb, producing a real captured\n\"Connection refused\". A healthcheck plus condition: service_healthy\nfixes it -- re-run twice with identical results.\n\nAlso fixes a self-caused gap: flashcards/README.md''s dated note-chain\nhad silently skipped the previous day''s T-2427 deck entry.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqtFGBCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHeYQAKd0CjYniprszZjpkLN/iOXi\nAA6dyup0WwYafYNSs3r9spAj8ffETsf21J+0DCIWduIEpFkKL7rIUgX5smSo5yGT\nPY4nTPWv1IzWNtm6GYyolsrPReQp+O2KpcMFP8PbYQsi6qDAdyZcsjI78GVCCgwF\nlNoYZnIA/ure/W7OYSeP0YbKTQKNlXlORbhtplw9zeWd3yS6Pkl6l2kux+Boga9M\n8/itok+e2J/GLXLWpMw5mU6HqAW3xtUvVFBvh53U/Lfp9a/IQLfI9gUR7JhOt7qv\nBE2WgF1u8BNHHDbyg7WFWp5FpLku2Nk8Vu6Z2yBZGkJdq7Rd/B6eZ7dnwcHEG47Q\n7PavJU/Eq0V7OUdz1CBfp4aJXdSlPpcj/NOg3dy2Q53lvg4FJk+oj9NpKPZbAJdt\nlR7OV1NcYCEHFV2/GTkH2Neh2rRX2dQU53oLMuiQS8USsUL8izfSwjUhbCnt4Gwp\njpmW3pozaN+XTQHx8Pqn1Vc7he7DsbZT48EEMbYON3w9zKZ61beoiULireCo6SiU\nJNinJyM/6cw++kq+cJE57+JsxaMr7uiSE1ZYCCAMyFsNLHy/z5mJZ4IxDCskWUC4\nHrFrxxCKEvZxrIpNF42k4zEA5xUDNbNCeD2CGw0UeLjTNLuIwcpS0mud4MNZLENC\nBXktHYlpYnDNLCAwLBJp\n=IWZy\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-09-23T22:24:02Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow