a real 375px-viewport check\nneither tool had before.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"0651280d569738ec469327328467eb71db1aca48","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuanMelendres/cracking-code-interviews/git/trees/0651280d569738ec469327328467eb71db1aca48"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/JuanMelendres/cracking-code-interviews/git/commits/5b99778dd0c10a9f234303b99a8b971aa6140750","verification":{"payload":"tree 0651280d569738ec469327328467eb71db1aca48\nparent ccf2631118d5ae99820c6868d0ef63bb516f03e5\nauthor Juan Antonio Melendres Villa <juan.mele97@gmail.com> 1790097817 -0600\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1790097817 -0600\n\ntest: add committed E2E regression suite + 375px mobile check for interactive tools (#147)\n\nDesign canvas and whiteboard timer (PRs #96, #97) were only verified with\nan ephemeral, uncommitted Playwright harness. Adds a real, re-runnable\nPlaywright suite under architecture-atlas/interactive-tools-e2e/ that runs\nagainst the real built MkDocs site, plus a real 375px-viewport check\nneither tool had before.\n\nCo-authored-by: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqsrmZCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAB34QABTeq8ACBIYZQF7RyW10V1fX\nerKcegjl8AlZpCgMY+EvSkrfvaf/EET/My1fD9NjiSnv3oZD8FzLMxAVAYLXOHl7\nbrrHvKHEwLQxnuADNDW4vrXpoBdELFhIR1w3n1WO82OtAvpmToM4wk+X1/RSMB6W\nxb+87hkZq8VBSzKLsUBq1f/LFzh1I8pcoviFUvGiutzEhOdxplw4l8E8YMqZk1Mv\nVGhGIulv5Zcbi4Rw+IOtwDzLTIbp44ArfJVQx/eiTxIy1o1huHJqVKXOmt6eALB/\nH5bdjkpbKk+2hn32T/nxj6CtKHsK+U3IqG0QYKi3omY1BfW3Lo3WUzzNY3rKuJem\nQLkVx0c+hEa7ZlE7/iqxP28vchTRKcUHYIHCI0NniJ098/Zh5nZMyK+74eTncE4h\nGJ6mBzL/ajw7j70Ly0j4zguK7HbxeBPMgM+k7mgBKplXT0gtp5r5MPq3XNWsWTkF\nIWUuf2KNRsNkM+9oCVR9hKxNi4twFBbvV0sMaUSdlTwbid+NQbtYmUAeS+kv6UnI\nXD97IY0b95JKvSdk6JFNrLepGTEcWWa1oLlrbCnKHTpDLzB00Efqm0pMXdVuvtxU\nrmJ38eWKKFk0aq8THadfVaqBz6LQSi+3095zYeHM+16IuwnAXHYiC/LwRNNDGu92\nR7CMd4GXDn8mWrWGOubj\n=gVWK\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-