ceived_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/habibdeoraji/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/habibdeoraji/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/habibdeoraji/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/habibdeoraji","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/habibdeoraji/react-module-federation-demo/commits/4f39f5deb81b5cdaef215e7cbc55c42020941ada/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:13:10Z","email":"habibdeoraji@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Md Habib"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-29T19:13:10Z","email":"habibdeoraji@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Md Habib"},"message":"Strip boilerplate, unify deploy into one build, add Vercel config\n\n- Remove leftover Vite/React starter template content (child''s App.jsx/\n  App.css, unused logos/hero image/icon sprite, dead CSS variables)\n- child''s Vite base and Parent''s federation remote entry are now\n  mode-aware: localhost URLs in dev, same-origin /child-app/ path in\n  production\n- Add build-all.mjs (npm run build:all) to build both apps and merge\n  child''s output into build/child-app/, producing one deployable folder\n- Add vercel.json wiring that build into a single Vercel project, plus\n  the SPA-fallback rewrite client-side routes need","tree":{"sha":"c2885ff1880dcab285e2f55b81d164277fcfceea","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/habibdeoraji/react-module-federation-demo/git/trees/c2885ff1880dcab285e2f55b81d164277fcfceea"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/habibdeoraji/react-module-federation-demo/git/commits/4f39f5deb81b5cdaef215e7cbc55c42020941ada","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/50310080?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/habibdeoraji/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com