hub.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/abdulrahmancodes","id":81605929,"login":"abdulrahmancodes","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgxNjA1OTI5","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/abdulrahmancodes","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/965e033f3f5129521dc32b9e22852b72ad2a0a38/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T19:16:57Z","email":"81605929+abdulrahmancodes@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdul Rahman"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T19:16:57Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"[breaking-change] fix(server): return runAgent execution failures as result errors (#23390)\n\n## Summary\n\n- When `executeAgent` throws, `runAgent` now returns `{ success: false,\nerror }` instead of a GraphQL exception\n- Callers (workflows, Slack assistant, etc.) can surface the failure to\nusers instead of hanging or failing opaquely\n\nRun agent exception response error format breaking-change, errors moved\nfrom the GraphQL error channel into the response payload.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23390?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\">