c0f8d124","node_id":"C_kwDOTnk9wdoAKDg4NGY0NzA5ODJiMzgyYTBkNWI3MWE0MzE1NzQ2MWVlYzBmOGQxMjQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ndlomoro/twenty/commit/7b81d9ab83bf7a8978c7341810ac544b99b14c7f","sha":"7b81d9ab83bf7a8978c7341810ac544b99b14c7f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/7b81d9ab83bf7a8978c7341810ac544b99b14c7f"}],"sha":"884f470982b382a0d5b71a43157461eec0f8d124","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/884f470982b382a0d5b71a43157461eec0f8d124"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142569587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ehconitin","id":142569587,"login":"ehconitin","node_id":"U_kgDOCH9wcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/7b81d9ab83bf7a8978c7341810ac544b99b14c7f/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:08:39Z","email":"142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nitin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T14:08:39Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fix call-recorder REC badge rendering as empty boxes (#23415)\n\n## What was wrong\n\nThe bot camera image draws a \"REC\" pill on top of the workspace logo.\nThe label used an SVG `<text>` element, and sharp resolves SVG text\nthrough the host''s fonts. The runtimes that execute app logic functions\nship no fonts, so every character fell back to an empty box: the badge\nshowed \"▯▯▯\" instead of \"REC\" in real meetings. It looked fine locally\nbecause dev machines have fonts.\n\n## The fix\n\nDraw the label as vector outlines instead of text. \"REC\" is outlined\nonce from Inter SemiBold and stored as an SVG path constant, so the\nbadge renders the same on any host with no font lookup. The pill width\nis derived from its contents instead of hardcoded, and tests fail if\n`<text>` or `font-family` ever comes back.\n\n<img width=\"2120\" height=\"1191\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 19 16 46\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5fa0958-35ba-48da-be9c-a6af81ec2fa0\"\n/>\n\n\n1 -- the bug on prod\n2 -- how it looks when its not bugged on prod\n3 -- this branches changes\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23415?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"b80715b9db47e2ea895f83be468c2a81c38d29af","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/trees/b80715b9db47e2ea895f83be468c2a81c38d29af"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/commits/7b81d9ab83bf7a8978c7341810ac544b99b14c7f","verification":{"payload":"tree b80715b9db47e2ea895f83be468c2a81c38d29af\nparent 1fb1232a1743c3d8148875f68ba87d470f770f20\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1785247719 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785247719 +0000\n\nFix call-recorder REC badge rendering as empty boxes (#23415)\n\n## What was wrong\n\nThe bot camera image draws a \"REC\" pill on top of the workspace logo.\nThe label used an SVG `<text>` element, and sharp resolves SVG text\nthrough the host''s fonts. The runtimes that execute app logic functions\nship no fonts, so every character fell back to an empty box: the badge\nshowed \"▯▯▯\" instead of \"REC\" in real meetings. It looked fine locally\nbecause dev machines have fonts.\n\n## The fix\n\nDraw the label as vector outlines instead of text. \"REC\" is outlined\nonce from Inter SemiBold and stored as an SVG path constant, so the\nbadge renders the same on any host with no font lookup. The pill width\nis derived from its contents instead of hardcoded, and tests fail if\n`<text>` or `font-family` ever comes back.\n\n<img width=\"2120\" height=\"1191\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 19 16 46\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/c5fa0958-35ba-48da-be9c-a6af81ec2fa0\"\n/>\n\n\n1 -- the bug on prod\n2 -- how it looks when its not bugged on prod\n3 -- this branches changes\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23415?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaLfsCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAWL0QAFyLzJLvVaYl+3qY3r3+yds6\n1zUyL0EeCrZ8FkwPx/TbBmXAsQKS5ttfrradADIySkul8zTpIeb0NxB/YVu5MxOO\nZQUEtM7n/VfceH353q