i.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:37Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Guard stale chunk auto-reload against loops (#23362)\n\nAppErrorBoundary auto-reloads on stale chunk errors, but if the server\nkeeps returning stale assets (cached index.html, bad deploy) the reload\nlands back on the same failure and loops forever with no user\ninteraction. Follow-up to #23359, which broadens the errors that trigger\nthis reload.\n\n- Reload at most once per 60s per tab (sessionStorage timestamp); within\nthe cooldown the error fallback shows instead, with its manual Reload\nbutton still unguarded.\n- The auto-reload waits for the Sentry capture (`captureException` +\n`flush`), bounded by a 2s timeout so a broken network cannot stall the\nreload.","tree":{"sha":"c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/trees/c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/commits/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff","verification":{"payload":"tree c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7\nparent 2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1785233317 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785233317 +0000\n\nGuard stale chunk auto-reload against loops (#23362)\n\nAppErrorBoundary auto-reloads on stale chunk errors, but if the server\nkeeps returning stale assets (cached index.html, bad deploy) the reload\nlands back on the same failure and loops forever with no user\ninteraction. Follow-up to #23359, which broadens the errors that trigger\nthis reload.\n\n- Reload at most once per 60s per tab (sessionStorage timestamp); within\nthe cooldown the error fallback shows instead, with its manual Reload\nbutton still unguarded.\n- The auto-reload waits for the Sentry capture (`captureException` +\n`flush`), bounded by a 2s timeout so a broken network cannot stall the\nreload.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaH+2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYuUQAEK8o8c8k1F9p7WgZp8HWzKv\nQ0IyFc8oRIE01W+blObc8OGLbXoQXgA/WzwwFc5/2qUBjgyXf71MYkbFx+0x7kXB\nXw9E64eZJvHB4O+JCQ1qgY56a2nqpMnNH022tWL7AcKnJRtJKo64BeFVz9lQt7sl\nsCnv8cdJBMSznPiVVixEsPlpRQ9o/2PaRTubl3rGiZJ7RLiRRx2Y8o787K8SZQi+\n3zvtaxtcLNrwzj1qqb8H75HhTWbT2KLWUj8DJlHWvKewF1ezK1rr0WaSHOvBLKDE\n4WGpbrCl7vzPS3m99516vZixLm97zVCjbGYkG4k5AFzWahsgoqOFGgQHoOe44kwx\nDliF8+mP6LGIK7A9QKxnWMBVjGlypkPOd5oDSBhlmjiQRk1Dr4znrrtR6HkUYrSE\nzo9+iGoACUmjz8BxMPlhObrZtvdGcSeovFUMdEzy8BtqX8LAly9tG01dfsw680iA\n4j/4Ul+zD/roXzMVPXJ/Q54msuq1rg7bYyxYTDvFMLwxdSaWnU1Rpoi6DYDS9tq3\nR6i15uSZgDtbwUQAsr7/RAGc0yrfBS2eaCeHAMu/Sq7HybgkZdlP3JB6naj80Oh3\nj3DMfTjDLPdUl2G+zjnguAlAPE78QAyaapLBtiFMACDT71CE20iyTEWudb3f8cmF\n5h52+epEc34wPqmE2CjZ\n=W3bb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T21:16:20Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com