moro/twenty/commit/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d","sha":"0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d"}],"sha":"97bb56d47102c229554ec0a5768785c8467bcbbb","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/97bb56d47102c229554ec0a5768785c8467bcbbb"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:09Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:09Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump shell-quote 1.8.4 -> 1.10.0 (Dependabot) (#23331)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **shell-quote 1.8.4 -> 1.10.0**, clearing Dependabot alert\n[1769](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1769):\n**GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv / CVE-2026-13311** (high) - quadratic-complexity\nDenial of Service in `parse()` (CWE-407), vulnerable `<= 1.8.4`, fixed\n1.9.0.\n\nBoth consumers declare caret ranges - `@graphql-codegen/cli` (`^1.7.3`)\nand `concurrently` (`^1.8.1`) - so a recursive `yarn up -R shell-quote`\nlifts the single entry with **no resolution and no `package.json`\nchange**. Yarn resolves to 1.10.0, the latest in range (above the 1.9.0\nfix floor).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes.\n- Diff is `yarn.lock` only; shell-quote resolves to 1.10.0, no 1.8.4\nremains.\n- 1.10.0 published 2026-07-10, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","tree":{"sha":"93e096d42a704393fbe366579dbb4538144b1c3b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/trees/93e096d42a704393fbe366579dbb4538144b1c3b"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/commits/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d","verification":{"payload":"tree 93e096d42a704393fbe366579dbb4538144b1c3b\nparent 155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1785138909 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785138909 +0000\n\nfix: bump shell-quote 1.8.4 -> 1.10.0 (Dependabot) (#23331)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **shell-quote 1.8.4 -> 1.10.0**, clearing Dependabot alert\n[1769](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1769):\n**GHSA-395f-4hp3-45gv / CVE-2026-13311** (high) - quadratic-complexity\nDenial of Service in `parse()` (CWE-407), vulnerable `<= 1.8.4`, fixed\n1.9.0.\n\nBoth consumers declare caret ranges - `@graphql-codegen/cli` (`^1.7.3`)\nand `concurrently` (`^1.8.1`) - so a recursive `yarn up -R shell-quote`\nlifts the single entry with **no resolution and no `package.json`\nchange**. Yarn resolves to 1.10.0, the latest in range (above the 1.9.0\nfix floor).\n\n## Verification\n\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes.\n- Diff is `yarn.lock` only; shell-quote resolves to 1.10.0, no 1.8.4\nremains.\n- 1.10.0 published 2026-07-10, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZw7/CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAXUEQAJV4SLYjZVrv9ZfyWAx8c391\ns1bbyFWIX/5HJwmCtyiMaZkxOPwfk8pgcsekPMjD2SQFKumVgschpUH0JsWC6Zz7\nIkEG4QwgInGgn/IkiUjeggU9vXp+flcBC5/GDfAawYWWEeNV3cSvcGCGdpqAZcNV\nHcVcrOfsAA5M/GQPDGzVDWu4Ddw2uCf4ZWFQejDOG+RKuAgbqxYrAyqOcZ1GD0xe\nhJ32QuExB/uJI2aMkjt9tfRdXCLXldJDOw4s0pnGq9Wa7LqRa+8Non0Qjmvgw+eB\nim09XXYsewQ62sUEzl214FGVhCd9yhzotAuVFHWXsR2ixHtgVlINJkSKl5JyQn5j\ntlPhmENCIiuN6J51X6SK+pqP5ZKHkxcn7IqGIPgiE9WGSNAMEWMm92urd2EzOIAG\nSdmSqJety/SMf5WPiOabAGOpJK25Sk9U08axjyBRFX+rebldu8ptGK7O4xG1WVTL\nhV+ZYpDQEAS89ZCX/oEInyuZkwYJTtmCc6PSHLy8jwecd3TX1NaxIMDDffScg4+5\nhBfaTZ/rNp8hXkHfdixP+F4pdo5uJF7O0s72PpJJ+rEUx05+BctxUDh3lO+5vkfT\npjighQcmc3EregOApi8csOHbITZy1LLQJICSAvgFGAOzoJcv1LgvacZL6xHpsWT4\n334+1zV1XX4mN2BVAacH\n=/umi\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-29T21:16:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/ndlomoro/twenty/commit/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d","node_id":"C_kwDOTnk9wdoAKDBlZmM5MmIzZjNiMTVmMzNlZTk0OWYzYTMxOTU1NmVhYjk1NzYyMmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/ndlomoro/twenty/commit/155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1","sha":"155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1"}],"sha":"0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:04Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:04Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump tar to 7.5.21 across app lockfiles (Dependabot) (#23332)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar -> 7.5.21** in the 13 twenty-apps lockfiles that carry it\ntransitively, clearing **GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m** (medium) on those\nmanifests: uncontrolled recursion in `mapHas`/`filesFilter` allows an\nuncatchable stack-overflow DoS via a crafted long-path tar with member\nselection, vulnerable `<= 7.5.20`.\n\nApps covered: document-generator, hello-world, postcard, self-hosting,\ntwenty-partners, call-recorder, people-data-labs, twenty-discord,\ntwenty-exa, twenty-fireflies, twenty-last-contact, twenty-linear,\ntwenty-slack.\n\nEvery app reaches tar through a caret range (`^7.5.4`), so a recursive\n`yarn up -R tar` lifts it in each project with **no resolution and no\n`package.json` change** - the diff is 13 `yarn.lock` files and nothing\nelse.\n\n## Not included\n\n- **Root lockfile**: same advisory, shipped separately in #23330.\n- **`application-package/constants/seed-dependencies`**: the 14th\nmanifest with this advisory. Its `yarn.lock` is checksum-coupled to\n`DEFAULT_YARN_LOCK_CHECKSUM`, so it moves in its own PR with the\nconstant regenerated alongside.\n\n## Verification\n\n- tar resolves to **7.5.21** in all 13 lockfiles; nothing below remains.\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes in each of the 13 projects.\n- 7.5.21 published 2026-07-21, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","tree":{"sha":"2cb9b50b8d02c3b9f9a863627bbed49b8503edf3","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/trees/2cb9b50b8d02c3b9f9a863627bbed49b8503edf3"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/git/commits/155636d7d923a80df44eb80d27d9c93f7b38b9b1","verification":{"payload":"tree 2cb9b50b8d02c3b9f9a863627bbed49b8503edf3\nparent ad3291f4b40df661d03601ae1be11963bb0a44e3\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1785138904 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785138904 +0000\n\nfix: bump tar to 7.5.21 across app lockfiles (Dependabot) (#23332)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar -> 7.5.21** in the 13 twenty-apps lockfiles that carry it\ntransitively, clearing **GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m** (medium) on those\nmanifests: uncontrolled recursion in `mapHas`/`filesFilter` allows an\nuncatchable stack-overflow DoS via a crafted long-path tar with member\nselection, vulnerable `<= 7.5.20`.\n\nApps covered: document-generator, hello-world, postcard, self-hosting,\ntwenty-partners, call-recorder, people-data-labs, twenty-discord,\ntwenty-exa, twenty-fireflies, twenty-last-contact, twenty-linear,\ntwenty-slack.\n\nEvery app reaches tar through a caret range (`^7.5.4`), so a recursive\n`yarn up -R tar` lifts it in each project with **no resolution and no\n`package.json` change** - the diff is 13 `yarn.lock` files and nothing\nelse.\n\n## Not included\n\n- **Root lockfile**: same advisory, shipped separately in #23330.\n- **`application-package/constants/seed-dependencies`**: the 14th\nmanifest with this advisory. Its `yarn.lock` is checksum-coupled to\n`DEFAULT_YARN_LOCK_CHECKSUM`, so it moves in its own PR with the\nconstant regenerated alongside.\n\n## Verification\n\n- tar resolves to **7.5.21** in all 13 lockfiles; nothing below remains.\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes in each of the 13 projects.\n- 7.5.21 published 2026-07-21, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZw7oCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAA26sQAAM+2Ckl8Ww9yZVzmMPfnIi2\nzVxlUPOov5KiLb1X6fAu9NszBAV5pg3+NsPVugBKGX/dsYIxjXXeHef1theDCTy9\nvzWVQPIziH8QoRX+KS7jQYafdOKUu+qLlEMSlvhHJd/Mafslvvi780Upo7e3iNyq\nCb6D02hrjBQzBTNMXv083BUJZLJk1Y8nzwiI7G27ft//7M4YrKY7eZH2R+v0RxX+\nsgqGCxQNSpzr56xlJBpdNsRVcOnXLKTBYv9DpXCTEZpk618S2NvsY6cMxVekVeK+\nU5x1SezYr0pP4Z6RHlspSGCmcq5FKi7kXU2IrwuKbjKR+r/RolwmnPTqbEPT2WKI\nW58sSyWhRLMTII2iKLq4Udyfp/iiWIQeTYuFAeKJhuWImVJzFq16bXxnb4ZATNtD\nK44Uz0xpymXB3I8yse7qjXwFCRR4ywGRhXu1r5JuhKfecvp8Uf/L19TNKZqpwjf+\n7xD5noyjqk0RxPFXYIX7ny6oguuUW8V6nHgbS5dp8pXr75P9f01p4wRPmSbjW8AF\ngh+BKRuiUT3Pb12+vfirIgNIZAp6rqE9zUTUXsWkaLrOmOFVzwDpRDlme//Uw5n3\nKeUd2VmHTr/41ll1Yf3I0aiwQFGj35W4QLaG5s/bhjSvc8JZg+YZJepEKJu68ncF\njsGP1ebSM0pAbjIu+v9A\n=92GX\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE---