illaume-flambard","id":56681566,"login":"guillaume-flambard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjgxNTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/ndlomoro/twenty/commits/1e5b8e6db4f426a62c121219c90af19bcfb57933/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:10:49Z","email":"56681566+guillaume-flambard@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Flambard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:10:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(front): add accessible labels to icon-only options dropdown triggers (#23325)\n\n## Problem\n\nRefs #23127. Icon-only `LightIconButton` \"more options\" triggers\n(`IconDotsVertical`) render without an accessible name, failing WCAG\n4.1.2 (button-name) — screen readers announce nothing for them.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `aria-label={t`More options`}` to the affected dropdown triggers.\n`LightIconButton` already forwards `aria-label` and sets `aria-hidden`\non the icon when a label is present, so this is purely additive — no\nbehavioral or visual change.\n\nScoped to a coherent set of options-menu triggers (attachments, public\ndomains, SSO, connected accounts, field group config). Other unlabeled\nicon buttons can follow in separate PRs.\n\n## Verification\n\n`oxlint --type-aware` and `oxfmt` pass on all changed files. The label\nis i18n-wrapped via the existing `useLingui` macro already imported in\neach component.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://