.com/users/velez94/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/velez94","id":73402684,"login":"velez94","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjczNDAyNjg0","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/velez94","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/commits/9cfa231e3990856238e6d0ed38799e61a3cfec89/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-09-22T02:44:20Z","email":"avelez@labvel.io","name":"alejandro.velez"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-09-22T02:44:20Z","email":"avelez@labvel.io","name":"alejandro.velez"},"message":"docs: correct CloudFormation Hooks details against AWS docs\n\nVerified the Hooks content against the official AWS::CloudFormation::GuardHook\nreference and fixed inaccuracies from the initial draft:\n\n- GuardHook example now matches the real schema: valid TargetOperations\n  (STACK|RESOURCE|CHANGE_SET|CLOUD_CONTROL), Alias naming rules (Name1::Name2::\n  Name3, no AWS prefix), TargetFilters, LogBucket, StackFilters.StackNames, and\n  the required HookExecutionRole (hooks.cloudformation.amazonaws.com trust + S3)\n- Name both native types: AWS::CloudFormation::GuardHook / ::LambdaHook\n- Soften overstated ''unbypassable / any principal / every stack op'' framing to\n  the accurate scoping: runs for targeted operations in the accounts/Regions\n  where the Hook is registered, regardless of who initiates the deploy\n- Fix cfn-guard doc link","tree":{"sha":"db8d16a2320c18d6f2c