7k+ lines\n\nModern Cloud-Native Serverless Framework on AWS covering:\n- Architecture principles (16-Factor, Cell-Based, Hexagonal)\n- Platform Engineering (IDP → ADP evolution)\n- AI-SDLC (AWS AI-DLC methodology)\n- DevOps/CI-CD (TPF, Ten Pillars, DORA)\n- Infrastructure (CDK + Express, Lambda, ECS, EventBridge)\n- Operations (OTEL, Security, DR, FinOps)\n- APIOps & Data Strategy\n- 6 hands-on workshops (Serverless, Enterprise CDK, ECS, CI/CD, Micro-Frontends)\n- Built with Zensical (static site generator)","tree":{"sha":"eb9f9141331d8d87f74232a9d9003a3677326a26","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/git/trees/eb9f9141331d8d87f74232a9d9003a3677326a26"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/git/commits/6ce6f43e81e6b48eb7b2a0bce3c7db1464ac1d69","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":null,"html_url":"https://github.com/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/commit/6ce6f43e81e6b48eb7b2a0bce3c7db1464ac1d69","node_id":"C_kwDOTn13xtoAKDZjZTZmNDNlODFlNmI0OGViN2IyYTBiY2UzYzdkYjE0NjRhYzFkNjk","parents":[],"sha":"6ce6f43e81e6b48eb7b2a0bce3c7db1464ac1d69","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/commits/6ce6f43e81e6b48eb7b2a0bce3c7db1464ac1d69"}],"requestUrl":"https://api.github.com/repos/thothforge/cloud-native-framework/commits?per_page=100&page=1&sha=984d0d8badc90aeabb8da841891a6cc12fbc4839&since=2025-03-31T23%3A59%3A59.000Z&until=2026-10-08T16%3A01%3A13.704Z"}');
