type=\"number\" value={42}>` was rejected by the\nvalue sync guard, so nothing was written to the host element\n- uncontrolled: `defaultValue={42}` was dropped from the initial value\nseeding\n\nNumeric values are now stringified in both places. Also adds a test\nasserting `createCaretPreservingElement` forwards its ref to the\nrendered element.\n\nThe controlled case and the ref test were flagged by cubic on #23264","tree":{"sha":"11d55f3bd91f92b321ca8b7f302b9a33b83f9084","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/11d55f3bd91f92b321ca8b7f302b9a33b83f9084"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/64001591f29fffce37d8935878c3153d6054c9ed","verification":{"payload":"tree 11d55f3bd91f92b321ca8b7f302b9a33b83f9084\nparent 4c904aa44c44075d26baa95c684481618d7ab272\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1785242635 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785242635 +0000\n\nFix numeric controlled input values in front components (#23421)\n\nA front component rendering a numeric input never showed its value\nbecause the caret-preserving path only accepted strings:\n- controlled: `<input type=\"number\" value={42}>` was rejected by the\nvalue sync guard, so nothing was written to the host element\n- uncontrolled: `defaultValue={42}` was dropped from the initial value\nseeding\n\nNumeric values are now stringified in both places. Also adds a test\nasserting `createCaretPreservingElement` forwards its ref to the\nrendered element.\n\nThe controlled case and the ref test were flagged by cubic on #23264","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaKQcCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAJEIQAJSUZjlxrE6aGygnF6bUm/XP\nvhROLkGtn5tQyzUAMZM+3ZdVg6HIxdpPiEWllkjE9wODIQL981cJOgQqHmfd924Q\nrO4wKB1/UV2RfXtIYrg6DvQ3sizvSoeUZM1GiMxacltbRRKwVRqEjetVbALN7Mfn\nM5DsrxOZUKKuhcb2YcbRQ8iCnpGoEXizIN3bf8VIqjRXk6mitmpfnGRxVlwletE9\nqHKE9TU4pYtzRp2rTwAffwuo6RVBlr+Nrb2BMwqQgbXo7SknWD77jWWdDx