y}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:37Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:37Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Guard stale chunk auto-reload against loops (#23362)\n\nAppErrorBoundary auto-reloads on stale chunk errors, but if the server\nkeeps returning stale assets (cached index.html, bad deploy) the reload\nlands back on the same failure and loops forever with no user\ninteraction. Follow-up to #23359, which broadens the errors that trigger\nthis reload.\n\n- Reload at most once per 60s per tab (sessionStorage timestamp); within\nthe cooldown the error fallback shows instead, with its manual Reload\nbutton still unguarded.\n- The auto-reload waits for the Sentry capture (`captureException` +\n`flush`), bounded by a 2s timeout so a broken network cannot stall the\nreload.","tree":{"sha":"c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff","verification":{"payload":"tree c88e3e34c4e5e4f7be80ba26ff36ef8ddb1234b7\nparent 2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1785233317 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785233317 +0000\n\nGuard stale chunk auto-reload against loops (#23362)\n\nAppErrorBoundary auto-reloads on stale chunk errors, but if the server\nkeeps returning stale assets (cached index.html, bad deploy) the reload\nlands back on the same failure and loops forever with no user\ninteraction. Follow-up to #23359, which broadens the errors that trigger\nthis reload.\n\n- Reload at most once per 60s per tab (sessionStorage timestamp); within\nthe cooldown the error fallback shows instead, with its manual Reload\nbutton still unguarded.\n- The auto-reload waits for the Sentry capture (`captureException` +\n`flush`), bounded by a 2s timeout so a broken network cannot stall the\nreload.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaH+2CRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAYuUQAEK8o8c8k1F9p7WgZp8HWzKv\nQ0IyFc8oRIE01W+blObc8OGLbXoQXgA/WzwwFc5/2qUBjgyXf71MYkbFx+0x7kXB\nXw9E64eZJvHB4O+JCQ1qgY56a2nqpMnNH022tWL7AcKnJRtJKo64BeFVz9lQt7sl\nsCnv8cdJBMSznPiVVixEsPlpRQ9o/2PaRTubl3rGiZJ7RLiRRx2Y8o787K8SZQi+\n3zvtaxtcLNrwzj1qqb8H75HhTWbT2KLWUj8DJlHWvKewF1ezK1rr0WaSHOvBLKDE\n4WGpbrCl7vzPS3m99516vZixLm97zVCjbGYkG4k5AFzWahsgoqOFGgQHoOe44kwx\nDliF8+mP6LGIK7A9QKxnWMBVjGlypkPOd5oDSBhlmjiQRk1Dr4znrrtR6HkUYrSE\nzo9+iGoACUmjz8BxMPlhObrZtvdGcSeovFUMdEzy8BtqX8LAly9tG01dfsw680iA\n4j/4Ul+zD/roXzMVPXJ/Q54msuq1rg7bYyxYTDvFMLwxdSaWnU1Rpoi6DYDS9tq3\nR6i15uSZgDtbwUQAsr7/RAGc0yrfBS2eaCeHAMu/Sq7HybgkZdlP3JB6naj80Oh3\nj3DMfTjDLPdUl2G+zjnguAlAPE78QAyaapLBtiFMACDT71CE20iyTEWudb3f8cmF\n5h52+epEc34wPqmE2CjZ\n=W3bb\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T06:28:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff","node_id":"C_kwDOTn4gOtoAKDQ2Y2Y0Y2ViZDE2NWMyOGI4ZTdiNjg0NzdiNmNkYmE1NzcxYjdjZmY","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b","sha":"2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b"}],"sha":"46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/46cf4cebd165c28b8e7b68477b6cdba5771b7cff"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/71827178?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/bosiraphael","id":71827178,"login":"bosiraphael","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjcxODI3MTc4","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bosiraphael","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:17Z","email":"71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Raphaël Bosi"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-28T10:08:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Redesign the external link popup for front components (#23404)\n\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"1866\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 11 52\n15@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de081951-6b1f-4194-8452-8395a90f3746\"\n/>\n\n\nApplies the Figma design to the confirmation popup shown before a front\ncomponent navigates to an external site.\n\nNew copy: \"Open external link?\", the destination as a pill, \"Always\nallow links to this domain\", and \"Open link\" as the confirm button. The\npopup is now its own component built on `ModalStatefulWrapper` because\n`ConfirmationModal`''s fixed spacing cannot produce the design''s layout.\n\nThe \"always allow\" checkbox stays checked by default, as before. The\npill is a non-interactive span rather than a `RoundedLink`, so the\ndestination cannot be opened outside the confirm flow, and it ellipsizes\nthe path so the domain stays readable.","tree":{"sha":"9819b282df6ba60942dbe240a0f5f7f7ed3bff56","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/9819b282df6ba60942dbe240a0f5f7f7ed3bff56"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/2bd1ece95200dc53312f8ffdde173f9b9162467b","verification":{"payload":"tree 9819b282df6ba60942dbe240a0f5f7f7ed3bff56\nparent 74260a161d9aae07769cdb5fd4c5496b7ab1a2a6\nauthor Raphaël Bosi <71827178+bosiraphael@users.noreply.github.com> 1785233297 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785233297 +0000\n\nRedesign the external link popup for front components (#23404)\n\n<img width=\"3840\" height=\"1866\" alt=\"CleanShot 2026-07-28 at 11 52\n15@2x\"\nsrc=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/de081951-6b1f-4194-8452-8395a90f3746\"\n/>\n\n\nApplies the Figma design to the confirmation popup shown before a front\ncomponent navigates to an external site.\n\nNew copy: \"Open external link?\", the destination as a pill, \"Always\nallow links to this domain\", and \"Open link\" as the confirm button. The\npopup is now its own component built on `ModalStatefulWrapper` because\n`ConfirmationModal`''s fixed spacing cannot produce the design''s layout.\n\nThe \"always allow\" checkbox stays checked by default, as before. The\npill is a non-interactive span rather than a `RoundedLink`, so the\ndestination cannot be opened outside the confirm flow, and it ellipsizes\nthe path so the domain stays readable.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqaH+hCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAoXYQAAYjofHj8XSL6055ygU5qiNi\nVerD6d81TOAu3cU2T0R2uy5u1KWXWeolfAnA3kZ4ywffIdilQUb5WsAkcwfunWf3\nD1f0mcoiT4v0wwMN6nbMpnusS7tXqTaEQ1t72ut/5TR+i1ZMB8G0grYNLquVgfUO\ndl7Q3WGg6zABNjN9/49XrERnpuaR4fQMkm/gPi4gYfD1NLDLULMmtR8QqSkEoY80\nZfecEpgCuDx/yd/FF3+RqxZgSYbQBEmFEbFWcDGhntnlM6HSDR7dexT1Wv/FEUBg\nsH47uyaJbBWKdUJ1GW5GWW96t4tFS0SaRezfeyRlm3mMkMOuunBWcIuWTNvmcpD7\nndhWQLYD2tXFICTP+wRcYnSEk6hYIm2kw20HiUKi0OyOdgzJ/JBmQvz1nKOV4aXw\nVPViKP0Tzo6ePnViBw19/n0KREs5F18qjQUVr4EaVw0p3J4dwgF1GM0OZfYArOyB\nCHVjhitSInvkUuqDBujuOUPQr1mfhEkqZO3HL2yeqL+YrPNvSrlCnXG843XSg5Bq\n