0bcd1cb9453a1e6bbd0c49330fdc61","node_id":"C_kwDOTn4gOtoAKDg4ZjIwYTM3MzEwYmNkMWNiOTQ1M2ExZTZiYmQwYzQ5MzMwZmRjNjE","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607","sha":"a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607"}],"sha":"88f20a37310bcd1cb9453a1e6bbd0c49330fdc61","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/88f20a37310bcd1cb9453a1e6bbd0c49330fdc61"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/142569587?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/ehconitin","id":142569587,"login":"ehconitin","node_id":"U_kgDOCH9wcw","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ehconitin","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:31:20Z","email":"142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com","name":"nitin"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:31:20Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"Fireflies: upgrade to twenty-sdk 2.23 (#23349)\n\nFireflies was skipped by both SDK bump sweeps (#23124, #23165) and sat\non `twenty-sdk ^2.18.0` with no `engines.twenty` floor, while the rest\nof the published set moved to `2.23.0-alpha.2`.\n\n- `twenty-sdk` / `twenty-client-sdk` `^2.18.0` -> `2.23.0-alpha.2`\n- adds `engines.twenty: \">=2.23.0\"`\n\nNo source changes needed: the 2.19 identifier migration (#22601) only\naffected apps referencing a standard object''s system-field identifier,\ndefining a relation into a standard object, or calling the field-UID\nderivation helper. Fireflies does none of those.\n\nThe `engines.twenty` floor means the app integration job needs a server\nimage at 2.23+, so it may fail on version mismatch rather than an app\ndefect, as in #22601.","tree":{"sha":"73a740e94a10828020e2788adc5ddf676081a401","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/73a740e94a10828020e2788adc5ddf676081a401"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607","verification":{"payload":"tree 73a740e94a10828020e2788adc5ddf676081a401\nparent cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a\nauthor nitin <142569587+ehconitin@users.noreply.github.com> 1785148280 +0530\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785148280 +0000\n\nFireflies: upgrade to twenty-sdk 2.23 (#23349)\n\nFireflies was skipped by both SDK bump sweeps (#23124, #23165) and sat\non `twenty-sdk ^2.18.0` with no `engines.twenty` floor, while the rest\nof the published set moved to `2.23.0-alpha.2`.\n\n- `twenty-sdk` / `twenty-client-sdk` `^2.18.0` -> `2.23.0-alpha.2`\n- adds `engines.twenty: \">=2.23.0\"`\n\nNo source changes needed: the 2.19 identifier migration (#22601) only\naffected apps referencing a standard object''s system-field identifier,\ndefining a relation into a standard object, or calling the field-UID\nderivation helper. Fireflies does none of those.\n\nThe `engines.twenty` floor means the app integration job needs a server\nimage at 2.23+, so it may fail on version mismatch rather than an app\ndefect, as in #22601