0NzQ2OWZlYTYwOGZhZjI2YjIxMjg3YTczYTc2MDc","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a","sha":"cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a"}],"sha":"a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/a6b36422f947469fea608faf26b21287a73a7607"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/1834158?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/Weiko","id":1834158,"login":"Weiko","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE4MzQxNTg=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Weiko","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:25:34Z","email":"corentin@twenty.com","name":"Weiko"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T10:25:34Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: block route triggers for suspended workspaces (#23347)\n\n## Problem\n\nLogic function route triggers (app HTTP endpoints served under `/s/*`\nand public domains) kept serving traffic for suspended workspaces. A\nworkspace suspended for non-payment (`activationStatus = SUSPENDED`)\nstill served its route triggers for the entire suspension window until\nsoft-deletion removed it from domain lookup. Every other trigger path\ngates on activation status — cron triggers only process `ACTIVE`\nworkspaces — but the route trigger path had no check at all.\n\n## Fix\n\n`RouteTriggerService.getLogicFunctionWithPathParamsOrFail` now rejects\nrequests when the resolved workspace has `activationStatus = SUSPENDED`,\nthrowing a `RouteTriggerException` with a new `WORKSPACE_SUSPENDED` code\nmapped to `403 Forbidden` in the REST exception filter. Scope is\nintentionally limited to `SUSPENDED`; other non-active statuses and the\nDB event trigger path are untouched.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23347?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","tree":{"sha":"1460e45e8a04602979b4abbc5e386e6923216d4f","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/1460e45e8a04602979b4abbc5e386e6923216d4f"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/cdd78462b90ef370e8c8863100687e3bd107da6a","verification":{"payload":"tree 1460e45e8a04602979b4abbc5e386e6923216d4f\nparent 5948c167a0ccd23ba9ae77749ae861d29eb82e87\nauthor Weiko <corentin@twenty.com> 1785147934 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785147934 +0000\n\nfix: block route triggers for suspended workspaces (#23347)\n\n## Problem\n\nLogic function route triggers (app HTTP endpoints served under `/s/*`\nand public domains) kept serving traffic for suspended workspaces. A\nworkspace suspended for non-payment (`activationStatus = SUSPENDED`)\nstill served its route triggers for the entire suspension window until\nsoft-deletion removed it from domain lookup. Every other trigger path\ngates on activation status — cron triggers only process `ACTIVE`\nworkspaces — but the route trigger path had no check at all.\n\n## Fix\n\n`RouteTriggerService.getLogicFunctionWithPathParamsOrFail` now rejects\nrequests when the resolved workspace has `activationStatus = SUSPENDED`,\nthrowing a `RouteTriggerException` with a new `WORKSPACE_SUSPENDED` code\nmapped to `403 Forbidden` in the REST exception filter. Scope is\nintentionally limited to `SUSPENDED`; other non-active statuses and the\nDB event trigger path are untouched.\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23347?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n\n---------\n\nCo-authored-by: Copilot Autofix powered by AI <62310815+github-advanced-security[bot]@users.noreply.github.com>","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZzIuCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAuowQAEVA6Elj08X0hlH9Xq+QjTNJ\nt30902DR+1U2MO60XxFTO9pi4BXwajbWf4X18lsdihhyCt/19vjfrYioDAWPrtNy\n0EyAeUamAdsjCG4PCc6ECJACi6AYDoK6RgsqULpekimOvt+VV7QTq+KInjZTR9FV\n3vp/KNHnblk5gK6fTM+hhZzEZtjkv70RrE6kquTt