0e7a908738e2a53c16fc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/ed95b8cfde1f8fd79393a0d5d3a9350184fe9f6d/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:50:00Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T08:50:00Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump postcss to 8.5.22 across app lockfiles (Dependabot) (#23340)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **postcss -> 8.5.22** in the 13 twenty-apps lockfiles that carry\nit transitively, clearing **GHSA-r28c-9q8g-f849** (high) on those\nmanifests: path traversal in previous source map auto-loading\n(`sourceMappingURL`) leading to arbitrary `.map` file disclosure,\nvulnerable `<= 8.5.17`.\n\nApps covered: document-generator, hello-world, postcard, self-hosting,\ntwenty-partners, call-recorder, people-data-labs, twenty-discord,\ntwenty-exa, twenty-fireflies, twenty-last-contact, twenty-linear,\ntwenty-slack.\n\nEvery app reaches postcss through a caret range (`^8.5.15`), so a\nrecursive `yarn up -R postcss` lifts it in each project with **no\nresolution and no `package.json` change** - the diff is 13 `yarn.lock`\nfiles and nothing else. Yarn resolves to **8.5.22**, the latest in range\n(above the 8.5.18 fix floor).\n\n## Not included\n\nThe **root lockfile** carries the same advisory but its postcss copies\nare held by exact pins - `next` (8.4.31 in every stable release,\nincluding 16.2.11) and `@mintlify/common` (8.5.14, unchanged in its\nlatest) - so no `yarn up` reaches it. That one needs a scoped resolution\nand is handled separately.\n\n## Verification\n\n- postcss resolves to **8.5.22** in all 13 lockfiles; nothing at or\nbelow 8.5.17 remains.\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes in each of the 13 projects.\n- 8.5.22 published 2026-07-22, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","tree":{"sha":"8a34e60ca671658444966c20891fcb12c8c9506a","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/8a34e60ca671658444966c20891fcb12c8c9506a"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/ed95b8cfde1f8fd79393a0d5d3a9350184fe9f6d","verification":{"payload":"tree 8a34e60ca671658444966c20891fcb12c8c9506a\nparent 6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1785142200 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785142200 +0000\n\nfix: bump postcss to 8.5.22 across app lockfiles (Dependabot) (#23340)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **postcss -> 8.5.22** in the 13 twenty-apps lockfiles that carry\nit transitively, clearing **GHSA-r28c-9q8g-f849** (high) on those\nmanifests: path traversal in previous source map auto-loading\n(`sourceMappingURL`) leading to arbitrary `.map` file disclosure,\nvulnerable `<= 8.5.17`.\n\nApps covered: document-generator, hello-world, postcard, self-hosting,\ntwenty-partners, call-recorder, people-data-labs, twenty-discord,\ntwenty-exa, twenty-fireflies, twenty-last-contact, twenty-linear,\ntwenty-slack.\n\nEvery app reaches postcss through a caret range (`^8.5.15`), so a\nrecursive `yarn up -R postcss` lifts it in each project with **no\nresolution and no `package.json` change** - the diff is 13 `yarn.lock`\nfiles and nothing else. Yarn resolves to **8.5.22**, the latest in range\n(above the 8.5.18 fix floor).\n\n## Not included\n\nThe **root lockfile** carries the same advisory but its postcss copies\nare held by exact pins - `next` (8.4.31 in every stable release,\nincluding 16.2.11) and `@mintlify/common` (8.5.14, unchanged in its\nlatest) - so no `yarn up` reaches it. That one needs a scoped resolution\nand is handled separately.\n\n## Verification\n\n- postcss resolves to **8.5.22** in all 13 lockfiles; nothing at or\nbelow 8.5.17 remains.\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes in each of the 13 projects.\n- 8.5.22 published 2026-07-22, clears the 3-day npm age gate.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZxvICRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAQNwQAGjatcGlvVPGvx9R42xz4kBC\n42etUBKiekDXFnwTGTUi2cSVuQRHNIoFOApeNqc7Uxqo4u5cARqAjPQ/NboKnIjp\nVpDPrMtXY934IG2Fsmj/uaIE+zu0BVsNAzSqGR6lLZWj6WKyDje5NLhAi0kyn2Ug\n9O2C+CB/I65blvqDqBsqv3e6oKcVBWJv9eFaP/MOuGYeDR+xQTSRpONIj4dute08\nD2V3nDOw5i2EMRcpAt9Nt5t9xdrMVmyW28Jzq8/wkFCnX/rE0mWf8zEsMLL5xJ/N\nixZ/n40Usn3/RxucMqfEJ3PN9tRrf860LRQN0BJbACgzhDd0aHsNox7xz1HkUM6J\ndKIBgLH4oBqiqDjo4hlPz6WLS9ypjkSgC+mkD/D8WX0pGfspqkCq+M4DFKm10ozH\nK7k7WRmkiMu0TxMuPogIMiJFsSRgiGti5VBd8Q63dN3TDEErQpvWRi2X+htabC5v\nMsWkuPYKDEO7EpNKJIsWNXuwdc/7EJpsBmns54eFmGxTtUaP1sHW7FooShm/VyIb\n+4IoKO6ZLpXlw3HWm1aKee3Al+DigxHv+woWNTr22i3ksyMavPe6JUGsKLhZ16gB\nXkNiHnEmQ0YwcD51gH2EiVsM4XDg1j/uWo/JcAkNv0aalRuOqjdlQbQ2QFz5f2La\nH9zHuXXSqRU/Q62pUYn7\n=V9Es\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T06:28:23Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/web-flow","id":19864447,"login":"web-flow","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE5ODY0NDQ3","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/ed95b8cfde1f8fd79393a0d5d3a9350184fe9f6d","node_id":"C_kwDOTn4gOtoAKGVkOTViOGNmZGUxZjhmZDc5MzkzYTBkNWQzYTkzNTAxODRmZTlmNmQ","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commit/6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88","sha":"6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88"}],"sha":"ed95b8cfde1f8fd79393a0d5d3a9350184fe9f6d","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/ed95b8cfde1f8fd79393a0d5d3a9350184fe9f6d"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:25Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:25Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21 in the root lockfile (Dependabot) (#23330)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21** in the root `yarn.lock`, clearing\nDependabot alert\n[1852](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1852):\n**GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m** (medium) - uncontrolled recursion in\n`mapHas`/`filesFilter` allows an uncatchable stack-overflow DoS via a\ncrafted long-path tar with member selection, vulnerable `<= 7.5.20`.\n\nEvery root tar consumer declares a caret range (`^7.4.3`, `^7.5.4`,\n`^7.5.9`, `^7.5.11`, `^7.5.16`) and the existing scoped tar resolutions\nfor the @electron/rebuild toolchain and @mintlify/previewing are carets\nas well (`npm:^7.5.16`), so a recursive `yarn up -R tar` lifts the\nsingle tar entry with **no resolution change and no `package.json`\nchange**.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes.\n- Diff is `yarn.lock` only; the single tar entry resolves to 7.5.21,\nnothing below remains.\n- 7.5.21 published 2026-07-21, clears the 3-day npm age gate.\n\nThe same advisory affects the twenty-apps and server fixture lockfiles;\nthose follow in separate PRs.","tree":{"sha":"64d2c800d526af81ba05e961f8db0e1d5ea12952","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/64d2c800d526af81ba05e961f8db0e1d5ea12952"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88","verification":{"payload":"tree 64d2c800d526af81ba05e961f8db0e1d5ea12952\nparent 97bb56d47102c229554ec0a5768785c8467bcbbb\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1785138925 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785138925 +0000\n\nfix: bump tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21 in the root lockfile (Dependabot) (#23330)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21** in the root `yarn.lock`, clearing\nDependabot alert\n[1852](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1852):\n**GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m** (medium) - uncontrolled recursion in\n`mapHas`/`filesFilter` allows an uncatchable stack-overflow DoS via a\ncrafted long-path tar with member selection, vulnerable `<= 7.5.20`.\n\nEvery root tar consumer declares a caret range (`^7.4.3`, `^7.5.4`,\n`^7.5.9`, `^7.5.11`, `^7.5.16`) and the existing scoped tar resolutions\nfor the @electron/rebuild toolchain and @mintlify/previewing are carets\nas well (`npm:^7.5.16`), so a recursive `yarn up -R tar` lifts the\nsingle tar entry with **no resolution change and no `package.json`\nchange**.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `yarn install --immutable` passes.\n- Diff is `yarn.lock` only; the single tar entry resolves to 7.5.21,\nnothing below remains.\n- 7.5.21 published 2026-07-21, clears the 3-day npm age gate.\n\nThe same advisory affects the twenty-apps and server fixture lockfiles;\nthose follow in separate PRs.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZw9FCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAregQAJyfklH1sO7iXdy/I+gBIbdF\nlcLpH8SbLlbFc6gwA+vYkP7iE1g248FfnkHLlrEk4wcrfDqor1g1Jgh3bYCX2Kkj\nDY0CcouYn2yCh8wfqTDsHj9xcEWG9SE/EFwoZAp+5asKVeWUWb0tCDMDE8L+fMi0\nLwLPBu7tzDkE0bmuIwIPIV7VZAA/O6+KrmSqOMEL+0Q1ubvfoEGlw2EmSRHDWYPy\nrHJG1kV7Sy1vai/pIqNs6X7Tg