6ff675a1b552b7f88","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/6060d88c5477a0870690aa26ff675a1b552b7f88"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/125115953?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/mabdullahabaid","id":125115953,"login":"mabdullahabaid","node_id":"U_kgDOB3UeMQ","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/mabdullahabaid","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/97bb56d47102c229554ec0a5768785c8467bcbbb/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:17Z","email":"125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Abdullah."},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:55:17Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix: bump tar and brace-expansion in seed-dependencies (Dependabot) (#23333)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21** and **brace-expansion 5.0.7 -> 5.0.8** in\nthe `application-package/constants/seed-dependencies` fixture:\n\n| Severity | Advisory | Package | Alert |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| medium | GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m | tar (`<= 7.5.20`) |\n[1850](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1850) |\n| high | GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg | brace-expansion |\n[1856](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1856) |\n\nBoth are reached through caret ranges (`^7.5.4`, `^5.0.2`), so the\nlockfile diff comes from a plain recursive `yarn up` - no resolution, no\n`package.json` change.\n\n## Checksum coupling\n\nThis fixture is read at runtime by `getDefaultApplicationPackageFields`\nand pinned by stored constants (first 32 hex chars of SHA512).\n**`DEFAULT_YARN_LOCK_CHECKSUM`** is regenerated to match the new\nlockfile. `package.json` is byte-untouched so\n`DEFAULT_PACKAGE_JSON_CHECKSUM` stays as-is.\n\nVerified in order: the hash formula reproduces **both** current\nconstants before regenerating; the new constant matches the new content;\n`yarn install --immutable` passes in the fixture.\n\n## sharp deliberately excluded\n\nThe third open alert here (GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj, high - inherited libvips\nCVEs) is **not** a lockfile lift: sharp is a *direct* dependency of this\nfixture at `^0.34.5`, so clearing it means moving the declared range to\n`^0.35.0`. That changes the package set exposed to user logic functions,\nshifts `DEFAULT_PACKAGE_JSON_CHECKSUM` too, and sharp 0.35 raises its\nengines floor from Node 18 to `>=20.9.0` while Lambda layers are still\nadvertised as NODE18-compatible. The same `^0.34.5` ceiling gates\ntwenty-sdk and 15 app manifests, so it deserves one coordinated decision\nrather than a drive-by change here.","tree":{"sha":"1b673eadc3c3c1f16129e086a6302b7b76e03519","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/1b673eadc3c3c1f16129e086a6302b7b76e03519"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/97bb56d47102c229554ec0a5768785c8467bcbbb","verification":{"payload":"tree 1b673eadc3c3c1f16129e086a6302b7b76e03519\nparent 0efc92b3f3b15f33ee949f3a319556eab957622d\nauthor Abdullah. <125115953+mabdullahabaid@users.noreply.github.com> 1785138917 +0500\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785138917 +0000\n\nfix: bump tar and brace-expansion in seed-dependencies (Dependabot) (#23333)\n\n## Summary\n\nBumps **tar 7.5.20 -> 7.5.21** and **brace-expansion 5.0.7 -> 5.0.8** in\nthe `application-package/constants/seed-dependencies` fixture:\n\n| Severity | Advisory | Package | Alert |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| medium | GHSA-r292-9mhp-454m | tar (`<= 7.5.20`) |\n[1850](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1850) |\n| high | GHSA-mh99-v99m-4gvg | brace-expansion |\n[1856](https://github.com/twentyhq/twenty/security/dependabot/1856) |\n\nBoth are reached through caret ranges (`^7.5.4`, `^5.0.2`), so the\nlockfile diff comes from a plain recursive `yarn up` - no resolution, no\n`package.json` change.\n\n## Checksum coupling\n\nThis fixture is read at runtime by `getDefaultApplicationPackageFields`\nand pinned by stored constants (first 32 hex chars of SHA512).\n**`DEFAULT_YARN_LOCK_CHECKSUM`** is regenerated to match the new\nlockfile. `package.json` is byte-untouched so\n`DEFAULT_PACKAGE_JSON_CHECKSUM` stays as-is.\n\nVerified in order: the hash formula reproduces **both** current\nconstants before regenerating; the new constant matches the new content;\n`yarn install --immutable` passes in the fixture.\n\n## sharp deliberately excluded\n\nThe third open alert here (GHSA-f88m-g3jw-g9cj, high - inherited libvips\nCVEs) is **not** a lockfile lift: sharp is a *direct* dependency of this\nfixture at `^0.34.5`, so clearing it means moving the declared range to\n`^0.35.0`. That changes the package set exposed to user logic functions,\nshifts `DEFAULT_PACKAGE_JSON_CHECKSUM` too, and sharp 0.35 raises its\nengines floor from Node 18 to `>=20.9.0` while Lambda layers are still\nadvertised as NODE18-compatible. The same `^0.34.5` ceiling gates\ntwenty-sdk and 15 app manifests, so it deserves one coordinated decision\nrather than a drive-by change here.","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZw8iCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAx2UQACp4D+sNXJFX+YoNv9aaigfG\nMZRURm4EaK3/eqOjWGoCGbiiP9gWZ8XxsdkfnzH