b.com/users/guillaume-flambard/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/guillaume-flambard","id":56681566,"login":"guillaume-flambard","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjU2NjgxNTY2","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/guillaume-flambard","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/commits/1e5b8e6db4f426a62c121219c90af19bcfb57933/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:10:49Z","email":"56681566+guillaume-flambard@users.noreply.github.com","name":"Guillaume Flambard"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-07-27T07:10:49Z","email":"noreply@github.com","name":"GitHub"},"message":"fix(front): add accessible labels to icon-only options dropdown triggers (#23325)\n\n## Problem\n\nRefs #23127. Icon-only `LightIconButton` \"more options\" triggers\n(`IconDotsVertical`) render without an accessible name, failing WCAG\n4.1.2 (button-name) — screen readers announce nothing for them.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `aria-label={t`More options`}` to the affected dropdown triggers.\n`LightIconButton` already forwards `aria-label` and sets `aria-hidden`\non the icon when a label is present, so this is purely additive — no\nbehavioral or visual change.\n\nScoped to a coherent set of options-menu triggers (attachments, public\ndomains, SSO, connected accounts, field group config). Other unlabeled\nicon buttons can follow in separate PRs.\n\n## Verification\n\n`oxlint --type-aware` and `oxfmt` pass on all changed files. The label\nis i18n-wrapped via the existing `useLingui` macro already imported in\neach component.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23325?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","tree":{"sha":"34c1121b7be9d3b6f7ba1f9d7e572fec80d1e572","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/trees/34c1121b7be9d3b6f7ba1f9d7e572fec80d1e572"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/nextpagetech/twentycrm-npt/git/commits/1e5b8e6db4f426a62c121219c90af19bcfb57933","verification":{"payload":"tree 34c1121b7be9d3b6f7ba1f9d7e572fec80d1e572\nparent 4f9fd6f67447c6ff1ca3d2ad0d9aae6f37645fb7\nauthor Guillaume Flambard <56681566+guillaume-flambard@users.noreply.github.com> 1785136249 +0200\ncommitter GitHub <noreply@github.com> 1785136249 +0000\n\nfix(front): add accessible labels to icon-only options dropdown triggers (#23325)\n\n## Problem\n\nRefs #23127. Icon-only `LightIconButton` \"more options\" triggers\n(`IconDotsVertical`) render without an accessible name, failing WCAG\n4.1.2 (button-name) — screen readers announce nothing for them.\n\n## Fix\n\nAdd `aria-label={t`More options`}` to the affected dropdown triggers.\n`LightIconButton` already forwards `aria-label` and sets `aria-hidden`\non the icon when a label is present, so this is purely additive — no\nbehavioral or visual change.\n\nScoped to a coherent set of options-menu triggers (attachments, public\ndomains, SSO, connected accounts, field group config). Other unlabeled\nicon buttons can follow in separate PRs.\n\n## Verification\n\n`oxlint --type-aware` and `oxfmt` pass on all changed files. The label\nis i18n-wrapped via the existing `useLingui` macro already imported in\neach component.\n\n\n<!-- This is an auto-generated description by cubic. -->\n<a\nhref=\"https://cubic.dev/pr/twentyhq/twenty/pull/23325?utm_source=github\"\ntarget=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"\ndata-no-image-dialog=\"true\"><picture><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"><source\nmedia=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\"\nsrcset=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-light.svg\"><img\nalt=\"Review in cubic\"\nsrc=\"https://www.cubic.dev/buttons/review-in-cubic-dark.svg\"></picture></a>\n<!-- End of auto-generated description by cubic. -->","reason":"valid","signature":"-----BEGIN PGP SIGNATURE-----\n\nwsFcBAABCAAQBQJqZwSJCRC1aQ7uu5UhlAAAHKQQAFCaX0U6IwOEU4rbGY7N3IBC\n47vptsfHpTtjb89G0D4NRPa8ILTUJ6RfQ1HTF4k1gdSTEla+6TNJNG1ecS0fkBFs\nJF2BgUiQPVePhoCpq5CcsE0t0dvcwaoH7z1FOHSD98m8m1H/2yYb0dkO49ifDvuI\npnO3splf2kyFWaGl3vS/V5UyU+M7NhsHStwnoMo0Xks+rFg++LqhYQsGfpZKDnAF\nEPja1OrxkFkANzNrvYrONz9EQlQCOYlmsQXBb3pcfd2IneV8nKIpqJLtb9N8bG0U\nbhW53PiCL7HodWKFZofaxbD0xb5YkXWDnM0jv2VuLsVaGwfbP226h/5HkWDm3bZg\n4sUNZBW73DuCU/VEfT8jfok8hXW05aHiXm4I3Dtbj7tgCy8eF46j139eFhiVKE4M\nyIBg4EJieyS2aEn6uFMUBHHKGggFn4K4XtiC4ONqvRldR7X4ezNueNt4LvTZDI48\nvr/d3Um8lIweGcjO+koM8McdWvFiIH8Y+vY1o2u7Q28p5av7fDOqJXtdYzsL6RW4\n6ModBMDKxC3SbtkMLKvIJiI8RNa5C/OQSrUNvi0IsutFCuHmacYW1tdEoh0EhlJg\nLNnwQ1VcQM2sF3945WRzHpx+3xDTGefrxQImD+xl3eQo5J+M1Skob67Ip2hzzS0z\nXDuSltMo+qepGCMV9Moo\n=zVeo\n-----END PGP SIGNATURE-----\n","verified":true,"verified_at":"2026-07-30T06:28:19Z"}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/19864447?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/web-flow/events{/privacy}","followers_