nvocable/AuthoringTool in Fabric, FabricAuthoringAgent). Rewrite to the\ncommitted design: foundry runs the agent over DCP agent.run; Fabric delegates via\nDcpAuthoringClient -> FoundryDcpServer; model keyed from env. HLD \"Where the AI runs\"\nupdated with the DCP delegation mechanics. Adds a History note so the removed terms\nare not mistaken for current.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"119cb6b4f41e9c4bf67944dd654f5d9413cc9610","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/git/trees/119cb6b4f41e9c4bf67944dd654f5d9413cc9610"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/git/commits/1e977518a038dabcf1373df4401e8041c0a127bc","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4927159?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VinayVerma5","id":4927159,"login":"VinayVerma5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjcxNTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commit/1e977518a038dabcf1373df4401e8041c0a127bc","node_id":"C_kwDOTn5GU9oAKDFlOTc3NTE4YTAzOGRhYmNmMTM3M2RmNDQwMWU4MDQxYzBhMTI3YmM","parents":[{"html_url":"https://github.com/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commit/ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2","sha":"ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commits/ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2"}],"sha":"1e977518a038dabcf1373df4401e8041c0a127bc","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commits/1e977518a038dabcf1373df4401e8041c0a127bc"},{"author":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4927159?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VinayVerma5","id":4927159,"login":"VinayVerma5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjcxNTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5","user_view_type":"public"},"comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commits/ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2/comments","commit":{"author":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:11:01Z","email":"vinayverma5@gmail.com","name":"Vinay Verma"},"comment_count":0,"committer":{"date":"2026-06-23T11:11:01Z","email":"vinayverma5@gmail.com","name":"Vinay Verma"},"message":"AI contract authoring UI: conversation panel + client + design docs\n\nA conversational entry point in Fabric Studio that drives the existing\nneeds -> compose -> resolve -> compile -> export pipeline:\n- AuthoringConversationPanel + authoringSession bridging proposals into the\n  existing draftWorkspace / intents / signed-export flow.\n- fabric-validation-client converse method + mock API; host-shell wiring.\n- authoringNoBrowserModelSdk guard: the webapp makes no model call and holds no\n  provider key (the agent runs server-side, in-perimeter).\n- HLD-ai-contract-authoring + REPO-ai-contract-authoring-build-spec design docs.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>","tree":{"sha":"2995bfd48250e662cd9f88e074cac244edc6ffca","url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/git/trees/2995bfd48250e662cd9f88e074cac244edc6ffca"},"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/git/commits/ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2","verification":{"payload":null,"reason":"unsigned","signature":null,"verified":false,"verified_at":null}},"committer":{"avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/4927159?v=4","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/events{/privacy}","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/gists{/gist_id}","gravatar_id":"","html_url":"https://github.com/VinayVerma5","id":4927159,"login":"VinayVerma5","node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjQ5MjcxNTk=","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/orgs","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/received_events","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/repos","site_admin":false,"starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5/subscriptions","type":"User","url":"https://api.github.com/users/VinayVerma5","user_view_type":"public"},"html_url":"https://github.com/UnfurlSystemsLab/unfurl-ui/commit/ed5f4ed113a9467a98f7d1f43bf8c78d618337a2","node_id":"C_kwDOTn5GU9oAKGVkNWY0ZWQxMTNhOTQ2N2E5OG